{"id":"2026-07-04-10","date":"2026-07-04","title":"Cost centers now support AI credit pools","original_url":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-02-cost-centers-now-support-included-usage-caps/","source_url":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-02-cost-centers-now-support-included-usage-caps/","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"GitHub Changelog","source_type":"github_release","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","published_at":"2026-07-02T16:00:51Z","observed_at":"2026-07-04T19:30:27+08:00","source_mix_note":"primary_verification：官方 changelog 原文可达；补充进入 longlist 因其直接对应企业 AI 成本治理。","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"GitHub says cost centers can cap how much of an enterprise monthly included AI credit pool they use; REST API support is available and UI management is coming.","codex_summary":"Copilot 把 AI credit pool 与 cost center 绑定，说明企业 AI 采用已经进入预算归因、额度边界和 chargeback 阶段。","display_summary":"GitHub Changelog 发布 Cost centers now support AI credit pools；企业可限制某个 cost center 使用共享 AI credit pool 的额度，REST API 已可用，成本中心 UI 管理即将推出。","priority":"P1","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"github-changelog/copilot-cost-centers-ai-credit-pools-2026-07-02","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"duplicate_7d","freshness_status":"recent_7d","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"能强化 2B AI PM 对预算、额度和部门归因的产品判断。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"文章说明 AI credit pool 独立于 cost center budget；前者限制 included usage pool，后者限制共享池耗尽后的 metered charges。","open_questions":"还需要确认 API 字段、UI 可见性、超额后拦截策略和与团队权限的关系。","confidence":"high","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-04T19:30:27+08:00","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","status":"inbox","tags":["enterprise AI","ROI","AI coding","developer tool","2B"],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B / ROI