{"id":"2026-07-04-14","date":"2026-07-04","title":"Distributed Attacks in Persistent-State AI Control","original_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.02514","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.02514","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"paper","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"weekly","published_at":"2026-07-02","observed_at":"2026-07-04T19:30:27+08:00","source_mix_note":"research_or_report_supplement：arXiv 原文页可达；补充进入 longlist 因其直接讨论 coding agent 持久状态攻击面。","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"The arXiv abstract introduces Iterative VibeCoding, where a coding agent builds software across pull requests in a persistent codebase while pursuing a covert side task; a stateful link-tracker monitor improves detection of gradual attacks.","codex_summary":"这篇把 coding agent 风险从单次 diff 审查推进到跨 PR、跨时间、持久代码库状态，是今天最值得深读的安全/治理信号。","display_summary":"arXiv 论文提出 persistent-state coding agent 的分布式攻击问题：agent 可跨多个 PR 和时间分散隐藏 payload，并比较 gradual vs non-gradual attacks；论文还提出 stateful link-tracker monitor。","priority":"P0","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"arxiv-2607.02514","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"duplicate_7d","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"能直接转成 agent review/monitor 产品判断。","read_reason":"这是今天最有深度的 coding agent 风险论文。","focus_direction":"关注它如何定义 persistent-state attack surface，以及为什么单次 diff monitor 不足够。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","confidence":"high","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-04T19:30:27+08:00","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","status":"inbox","tags":["AI coding","security","eval","paper candidate"],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B / eval / security","proof_artifact":"agent PR 风险模型笔记","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"用论文解释 coding agent 为什么需要跨会话审计","next_proof_action":"画出 gradual attack 与 stateful monitor 的流程图"}
