{"id":"2026-07-05-03","date":"2026-07-05","title":"Set AI credit session limits in Copilot CLI and SDK","original_url":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-01-set-ai-credit-session-limits-in-copilot-cli-and-sdk/","source_url":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-01-set-ai-credit-session-limits-in-copilot-cli-and-sdk/","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"GitHub Changelog","source_type":"github_release","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","published_at":"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z","observed_at":"2026-07-05T18:47:17+08:00","source_mix_note":"primary_verification：GitHub 官方 changelog 可达；补充进入 longlist，因为它直接对应 agent 成本护栏。","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"GitHub Copilot CLI 和 SDK 可设置 AI credit session limits，用于限制一个 agent session 的花费；达到限制后 agent 会收尾并提示，而不是继续运行。","codex_summary":"这把 agent 成本治理从组织预算推进到单次任务预算，是 2B agent 产品必须提供的运行时护栏。","display_summary":"GitHub 7 月 1 日发布 Copilot CLI / SDK AI credit session limits public preview：交互式 session 可用 `/limits` 查看、设置或移除限制；非交互运行可传 `--max-ai-credits`；限制覆盖模型调用、subagents 和 compaction 等后台工作，是 soft cap。","priority":"P1","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-github-blog-changelog-2026-07-01-set-ai-credit-session-limits-in-copilot-cli-and-sdk","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"recent_7d","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"对企业 AI 成本、无人值守自动化和运行时控制都有直接产品价值。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"文章说明 session limit 会统计模型调用、subagents、background compaction；非交互模式可通过 --max-ai-credits 约束单次运行。","open_questions":"需要确认实际 API 字段、超限后的任务状态、是否能按 repo/team policy 默认下发，以及 soft cap 超额范围如何展示。","confidence":"high","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-05T18:47:17+08:00","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","status":"inbox","tags":["AI coding","cost","agent","enterprise AI"],"interview_relevance"