{"id":"2026-07-06-01","date":"2026-07-06","title":"Enterprise managed-settings.json is generally available","original_url":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-01-enterprise-managed-settings-json-is-generally-available/","source_url":["enterprise AI","governance","Copilot","settings"],"source_origin":"primary","source_name":"GitHub Changelog","source_type":"github_release","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","published_at":"2026-07-01","observed_at":"2026-07-06T10:15:58+08:00","source_mix_note":"primary_verification：GitHub 官方 changelog 可达；补充进入 longlist，作为企业 AI 控制面信号。","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"GitHub 7 月 1 日宣布 Enterprise managed-settings.json GA：企业可在选定组织的 .github-private 仓库维护 copilot/managed-settings.json，为 VS Code 和 Copilot CLI 下发 extraKnownMarketplaces、enabledPlugins、strictKnownMarketplaces、disableBypassPermissionsMode、model 等 AI 标准配置；配置每次认证拉取并每小时刷新。","codex_summary":"企业 AI agent 产品正在从单点功能进入可治理配置层；对 2B AI PM 最有价值的是配置项、优先级、刷新机制和客户端覆盖范围。","display_summary":"GitHub 7 月 1 日宣布 Enterprise managed-settings.json GA：企业可在选定组织的 .github-private 仓库维护 copilot/managed-settings.json，为 VS Code 和 Copilot CLI 下发 extraKnownMarketplaces、enabledPlugins、strictKnownMarketplaces、disableBypassPermissionsMode、model 等 AI 标准配置；配置每次认证拉取并每小时刷新。","priority":"P1","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"github-blog-changelog-2026-07-01-enterprise-managed-settings-json-is-generally-available","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"recent_7d","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"这是今天最适合详细拆解的 2B agent 管理控制面案例。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"文章可获得的事实：可获得 supported keys、配置路径、支持客户端、刷新机制和与 AI Controls 的关系。","open_questions":"需要额外研究的问题：需要查 docs 确认每个 key 的完整 schema、冲突处理、审计记录和跨客户端覆盖计划。","confidence":"high","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":