、marketing 等业务用例，并提醒成本、数据质量、security、vendor lock-in 与 agent washing 风险。","open_questions":"需要额外研究的问题：需要用具体产品或客户案例确认 agent builder 的真实交付边界、常见集成系统、定价方式、权限治理、失败审核机制和 ROI 证明方法。","confidence":"medium","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-06T10:15:58+08:00","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B / AI PM / agent workflow / portfolio","proof_artifact":"mini spec / teardown / checklist","validation_window":"same day","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
