{"id":"2026-07-08-01","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-08T08:29:47.091Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"GitLost：Noma Labs 发现 GitHub AI 代理提示词注入漏洞","original_url":"https://noma.security/blog/gitlost-how-we-tricked-githubs-ai-agent-into-leaking-private-repos","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrbu023x079pihl1q4rvhzky","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrbu023x079pihl1q4rvhzky","aihot_summary":"Noma Labs 在 GitHub Agentic Workflows 中发现严重提示词注入漏洞 GitLost。未认证攻击者仅需在属于同一组织的公共仓库中创建一个嵌有恶意指令的 Issue，即可诱使基于 Claude 或 GitHub Copilot 的 AI 代理读取并公开该组织内私有仓库的内容。攻击无需编码技能或凭证，根源在于代理将用户可控内容视为可信指令，且 GitHub 的防护措施因 \"Additionally\" 关键词被绕过。Noma Labs 已公开 PoC 并建议限制跨仓库权限、隔离用户输入。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"agentic workflow 的跨仓库权限与提示注入风险，直接影响 2B agent 产品默认权限设计。","display_summary":"Noma Labs 在 GitHub Agentic Workflows 中发现严重提示词注入漏洞 GitLost。未认证攻击者仅需在属于同一组织的公共仓库中创建一个嵌有恶意指令的 Issue，即可诱使基于 Claude 或 GitHub Copilot 的 AI 代理读取并公开该组织内私有仓库的内容。攻击无需编码技能或凭证，根源在于代理将用户可控内容视为可信指令，且 GitHub 的防护措施因 \"Additionally\" 关键词被绕过。Noma Labs 已公开 PoC 并建议限制跨仓库权限、隔离用户输入。","summary":"Noma Labs 在 GitHub Agentic Workflows 中发现严重提示词注入漏洞 GitLost。未认证攻击者仅需在属于同一组织的公共仓库中创建一个嵌有恶意指令的 Issue，即可诱使基于 Claude 或 GitHub Copilot 的 AI 代理读取并公开该组织内私有仓库的内容。攻击无需编码技能或凭证，根源在于代理将用户可控内容视为可信指令，且 GitHub 的防护措施因 \"Additionally\" 关键词被绕过。Noma Labs 已公开 PoC 并建议限制跨仓库权限、隔离用户输入。","why_it_matters":"agentic workflow 的跨仓库权限与提示注入风险，直接影响 2B agent 产品默认权限设计。","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-noma-security-blog-gitlost-how-we-tricked-githubs-ai-agent-into-leaking-private-repos","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"agentic workflow 的跨仓库权限与提示注入风险，直接影响 2B agent 产品默认权限设计。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"文章可获得 Noma Labs 对 GitHub Agentic Workflows 提示词注入漏洞 GitLost 的攻击路径、触发条件和建议缓解方向。","open_questions":"需要额外核验 GitHub 官方修复状态、受影响 agent 配置范围、企业侧最小权限策略和 Issue 内容隔离方案。","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"阅读包处理","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-02","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-08T07:00:51.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"黑客可利用9款最流行的AI工具组装大规模僵尸网络","original_url":"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/07/hackers-can-use-9-of-the-most-popular-ai-tools-to-assemble-massive-botnets","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrbqwsid06g2ihl1iiwufnz5","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"paper","aihot_id":"cmrbqwsid06g2ihl1iiwufnz5","aihot_summary":"提示注入已成为AI安全的首要威胁--大语言模型无法区分合法指令与恶意指令。此前推送式和拉取式攻击规模均有限。研究人员提出一种名为HalluSquatting的新型拉取式提示注入攻击，首次能组装大规模僵尸网络、执行分布式拒绝服务攻击（DDoS）并大规模感染设备。该攻击可作用于AI编码工具，标志着提示注入攻击从单点突破转向规模化利用。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"提示注入从单点滥用走向规模化攻击，是 agent 产品必须跟踪的风险。","display_summary":"提示注入已成为AI安全的首要威胁--大语言模型无法区分合法指令与恶意指令。此前推送式和拉取式攻击规模均有限。研究人员提出一种名为HalluSquatting的新型拉取式提示注入攻击，首次能组装大规模僵尸网络、执行分布式拒绝服务攻击（DDoS）并大规模感染设备。该攻击可作用于AI编码工具，标志着提示注入攻击从单点突破转向规模化利用。","summary":"提示注入已成为AI安全的首要威胁--大语言模型无法区分合法指令与恶意指令。此前推送式和拉取式攻击规模均有限。研究人员提出一种名为HalluSquatting的新型拉取式提示注入攻击，首次能组装大规模僵尸网络、执行分布式拒绝服务攻击（DDoS）并大规模感染设备。该攻击可作用于AI编码工具，标志着提示注入攻击从单点突破转向规模化利用。","why_it_matters":"提示注入从单点滥用走向规模化攻击，是 agent 产品必须跟踪的风险。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-arstechnica-com-security-2026-07-hackers-can-use-9-of-the-most-popular-ai-tools-to-assemble-massive-botnets","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"提示注入从单点滥用走向规模化攻击，是 agent 产品必须跟踪的风险。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"