{"id":"2026-07-08-08","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-08T01:06:01.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Claude开发者分享两种多智能体模式：Advisor和Orchestrator","original_url":"https://x.com/shao__meng/status/2074661249804366310","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrbdqlcv02y4ihl11xbxx9xs","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：邵猛 (@shao__meng)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrbdqlcv02y4ihl11xbxx9xs","aihot_summary":"Claude开发者官方分享团队高频使用的两种多智能体模式。Advisor模式：Sonnet 5作为执行者，通过tool call调用Fable 5获取指导。SWE-bench Pro（482题）上，Sonnet 5单独75.5%/$0.75，加顾问达84%/$1.40，Fable 5单独91.5%/$2.25；组合方案约92%性能、63%成本。Orchestrator模式：Fable 5作为编排者规划并向多个Sonnet 5 worker扇出任务。BrowseComp上，全Sonnet 5 77.8%/$16.01，编排方案86.8%/$18.53，全Fable 5 90.8%/$40.56；编排方案约96%性能、46%成本。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Advisor / Orchestrator 模式可转成多 agent 成本与质量权衡练习。","display_summary":"Claude开发者官方分享团队高频使用的两种多智能体模式。Advisor模式：Sonnet 5作为执行者，通过tool call调用Fable 5获取指导。SWE-bench Pro（482题）上，Sonnet 5单独75.5%/$0.75，加顾问达84%/$1.40，Fable 5单独91.5%/$2.25；组合方案约92%性能、63%成本。Orchestrator模式：Fable 5作为编排者规划并向多个Sonnet 5 worker扇出任务。BrowseComp上，全Sonnet 5 77.8%/$16.01，编排方案86.8%/$18.53，全Fable 5 90.8%/$40.56；编排方案约96%性能、46%成本。","summary":"Claude开发者官方分享团队高频使用的两种多智能体模式。Advisor模式：Sonnet 5作为执行者，通过tool call调用Fable 5获取指导。SWE-bench Pro（482题）上，Sonnet 5单独75.5%/$0.75，加顾问达84%/$1.40，Fable 5单独91.5%/$2.25；组合方案约92%性能、63%成本。Orchestrator模式：Fable 5作为编排者规划并向多个Sonnet 5 worker扇出任务。BrowseComp上，全Sonnet 5 77.8%/$16.01，编排方案86.8%/$18.53，全Fable 5 90.8%/$40.56；编排方案约96%性能、46%成本。","why_it_matters":"Advisor / Orchestrator 模式可转成多 agent 成本与质量权衡练习。","priority":"P1","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"https-x-com-shao-meng-status-2074661249804366310","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"Advisor / Orchestrator 模式可转成多 agent 成本与质量权衡练习。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B / AI PM / agent workflow / portfolio","proof_artifact":"mini spec / teardown / checklist","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-09","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-08T01:00:00.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"蚂蚁集团周俊AICon演讲：从Token数量到Token密度，万亿参数模型效率优先","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dsIfi4C-T5Q4emmIh-7yzg","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrbdsefa02yjihl17gg7mhx3","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：蚂蚁百灵（Ling）","source_type":"newsletter","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrbdsefa02yjihl17gg7mhx3","aihot_summary":"蚂蚁集团副总裁周俊在AICon演讲指出，万亿参数模型每运行15分钟算力成本约等于一辆特斯拉，效率是智能体时代最需解决的问题。团队提出从\"更多Token\"转向\"更高Token密度\"策略，采用7份Lightning Attention加1份MLA的混合线性注意力架构，使256K长上下文成本从指数级降至线性级，算力更多用于思考。通过Kpop算法区分工具调用与自然语言Token，结合思维链剪枝、自蒸馏等，Token输出减少约4倍而能力不降。在LongBench、BFCL等基准上提升显著，千亿参数模型在Agent任务中超越部分更大模型；小模型flash吞吐达2.4倍，五轮对话成本下降10倍以上。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"token 密度和效率方向重要，但今天只做背景记录。","display_summary":"蚂蚁集团副总裁周俊在AICon演讲指出，万亿参数模型每运行15分钟算力成本约等于一辆特斯拉，效率是智能体时代最需解决的问题。团队提出从\"更多Token\"转向\"更高Token密度\"策略，采用7份Lightning Attention加1份MLA的混合线性注意力架构，使256K长上下文成本从指数级降至线性级，算力更多用于思考。通过Kpop算法区分工具调用与自然语言Token，结合思维链剪枝、自蒸馏等，Token输出减少约4倍而能力不降。在LongBench、BFCL等基准上提升显著，千亿参数模型在Agent任务中超越部分更大模型；小模型flash吞吐达2.4倍，五轮对话成本下降10倍以上。","summary":"蚂蚁集团副总裁周俊在AICon演讲指出，万亿参数模型每运行15分钟算力成本约等于一辆特斯拉，效率是智能体时代最需解决的问题。团队提出从\"更多Token\"转向\"更高Token密度\"策略，采用7份Lightning Attention加1份MLA的混合线性注意力架构，使256K长上下文成本从指数级降至线性级，算力更多用于思考。通过Kpop算法区分工具调用与自然语言Token，结合思维链剪枝、自蒸馏等，Token输出减少约4倍而能力不降。在LongBench、BFCL等基准上提升显著，千亿参数模型在Agent任务中超越部分更大模型；小模型flash吞吐达2.4倍，五轮对话成本下降10倍以上。","why_it_matters":"token 密度和效率方向重要，但今天只做背景记录。","priority":"P2","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-mp-weixin-qq-com-s-dsifi4c-t5q4emmih-7yzg","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"token 密度和效率方向重要，但今天只做背景记录。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"medium","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-10","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-08T00:12:06.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"《人生设计课》Prompt实测：用Claude设计人生的四个阶段","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VDlBdkspV0SQNFJYLxOogQ","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrbc048n02j2ihl1all0ymge","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","source_type":"newsletter","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrbc048n02j2ihl1all0ymge","aihot_summary":"作者将斯坦福《人生设计课》理论体系制成Prompt，通过Claude逐步提问、追问和分析。Prompt融合设计思维、心流理论和积极心理学，分为看清现状、找到指南针、寻路、制定奥德赛计划四阶段，主线问题控制在6到9个。AI引导用户给健康、工作、娱乐、爱打分，区分重力问题与可设计的真问题，生成三个五年人生版本，最终输出8000至12000字的《个人人生设计蓝图》。作者实测效果超预期。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"个人 prompt 案例与当前求职/工程证明主线弱。","display_summary":"作者将斯坦福《人生设计课》理论体系制成Prompt，通过Claude逐步提问、追问和分析。Prompt融合设计思维、心流理论和积极心理学，分为看清现状、找到指南针、寻路、制定奥德赛计划四阶段，主线问题控制在6到9个。AI引导用户给健康、工作、娱乐、爱打分，区分重力问题与可设计的真问题，生成三个五年人生版本，最终输出8000至12000字的《个人人生设计蓝图》。作者实测效果超预期。","summary":"作者将斯坦福《人生设计课》理论体系制成Prompt，通过Claude逐步提问、追问和分析。Prompt融合设计思维、心流理论和积极心理学，分为看清现状、找到指南针、寻路、制定奥德赛计划四阶段，主线问题控制在6到9个。AI引导用户给健康、工作、娱乐、爱打分，区分重力问题与可设计的真问题，生成三个五年人生版本，最终输出8000至12000字的《个人人生设计蓝图》。作者实测效果超预期。","why_it_matters":"个人 prompt 案例与当前求职/工程证明主线弱。","priority":"P2","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"https-mp-weixin-qq-com-s-vdlbdkspv0sqnfjylxoogq","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"个人 prompt 案例与当前求职/工程证明主线弱。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00"