{"id":"2026-07-08-11","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T20:22:46.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Krea 2 身份保留功能上线","original_url":"https://x.com/krea_ai/status/2074589965653303321","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrb4j2zx00n4ihl14u6xv7kz","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：Krea AI (@krea_ai)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrb4j2zx00n4ihl14u6xv7kz","aihot_summary":"Krea 2 的身份保留功能已发布，配套模型和 ComfyUI 节点也已上线。🔥","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"图像产品功能更新，当前不进入主线。","display_summary":"Krea 2 的身份保留功能已发布，配套模型和 ComfyUI 节点也已上线。🔥","summary":"Krea 2 的身份保留功能已发布，配套模型和 ComfyUI 节点也已上线。🔥","why_it_matters":"图像产品功能更新，当前不进入主线。","priority":"P2","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"https-x-com-krea-ai-status-2074589965653303321","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"图像产品功能更新，当前不进入主线。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"medium","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-12","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T19:33:53.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 推出 Muse Image 和 Muse Video","original_url":"https://x.com/AIatMeta/status/2074577662840832382","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrb2mxmc0072ihl1mx0aw1bz","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：AI at Meta (@AIatMeta)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"ai-models","aihot_id":"cmrb2mxmc0072ihl1mx0aw1bz","aihot_summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"媒体生成模型发布可留档，但对今日实践价值有限。","display_summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","summary":"Meta Superintelligence Labs 发布首个媒体生成模型 Muse Image 和 Muse Video。Muse Image 是目前最先进的图像生成模型，能精确遵循指令、精准编辑、多参考构图，并利用 Instagram 社交上下文。它还具备智能体工具使用能力并集成 Muse Spark。用户可通过 Meta AI 应用、网页、Instagram Stories 和 WhatsApp 试用，初始限于部分国家。Muse Video 基于相同预训练基础，实现高视觉保真度并原生支持音频。","why_it_matters":"媒体生成模型发布可留档，但对今日实践价值有限。","priority":"P2","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"https-x-com-aiatmeta-status-2074577662840832382","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"媒体生成模型发布可留档，但对今日实践价值有限。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"medium","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-13","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T18:35:58.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"微软为降成本在Copilot中用自研MAI模型替换OpenAI和Anthropic模型","original_url":"https://the-decoder.com/copilot-goes-cheap-as-microsoft-phases-out-openai-and-anthropic-models-to-cut-costs","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrb0u6pv02qtihogovduu795","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrb0u6pv02qtihogovduu795","aihot_summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"企业 Copilot 成本与模型路由是 2B AI 产品的重要商业信号。","display_summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","summary":"微软正用自研MAI模型替换Copilot产品中的OpenAI和Anthropic模型以降低支出。MAI模型已在Excel和Outlook中每周处理数万次请求，但占比仍小。Build大会上发布推理模型MAI-Thinking 1，声称编码媲美Sonnet 4.6和Opus 4.6，但基准测试大幅落后，仅与DeepSeek V3.2相当。AI负责人承认目标是削减并消除对Anthropic的支出。CEO暗示未来可能按用量计费，MAI为默认，第三方模型付费附加。微软称MAI使用干净商业许可数据，实际基于Common Crawl。","why_it_matters":"企业 Copilot 成本与模型路由是 2B AI 产品的重要商业信号。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-the-decoder-com-copilot-goes-cheap-as-microsoft-phases-out-openai-and-anthropic-models-to-cut-costs","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"企业 Copilot 成本与模型路由是 2B AI 产品的重要商业信号。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"","proof_artifact":"","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-14","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T17:52:12.864Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"YC CEO声称每日用AI部署3.7万行代码，开发者审查发现前端代码大量臃肿低效","original_url":"https://www.fastcompany.com/91520702/y-combinator-garry-tan-agentic-ai-social-media","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrayv5ja0293ihog3rixaqua","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"personal_blog","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrayv5ja0293ihog3rixaqua","aihot_summary":"Y Combinator CEO Garry Tan在X上宣称，他与AI编码代理每天在五个项目中部署37000行代码，并保持连续72天发布记录。波兰开发者Gregorein深入审查Tan网站前端代码，发现大量臃肿与低效问题：页面加载169次请求、总计6.42MB数据（对比Hacker News仅7次12KB）；包含28个测试文件、78个未使用的JavaScript控制器、八种格式Logo（含空文件）、未压缩的旧PNG等。Gregorein指出，AI虽能快速生成代码，但质量仍应优先于数量。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"AI 代码量指标的反例，适合用于面试中讨论质量与验证。","display_summary":"Y Combinator CEO Garry Tan在X上宣称，他与AI编码代理每天在五个项目中部署37000行代码，并保持连续72天发布记录。波兰开发者Gregorein深入审查Tan网站前端代码，发现大量臃肿与低效问题：页面加载169次请求、总计6.42MB数据（对比Hacker News仅7次12KB）；包含28个测试文件、78个未使用的JavaScript控制器、八种格式Logo（含空文件）、未压缩的旧PNG等。Gregorein指出，AI虽能快速生成代码，但质量仍应优先于数量。","summary":"Y Combinator CEO Garry Tan在X上宣称，他与AI编码代理每天在五个项目中部署37000行代码，并保持连续72天发布记录。波兰开发者Gregorein深入审查Tan网站前端代码，发现大量臃肿与低效问题：页面加载169次请求、总计6.42MB数据（对比Hacker News仅7次12KB）；包含28个测试文件、78个未使用的JavaScript控制器、八种格式Logo（含空文件）、未压缩的旧PNG等。Gregorein指出，AI虽能快速生成代码，但质量仍应优先于数量。","why_it_matters":"AI 代码量指标的反例，适合用于面试中讨论质量与验证。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"https-www-fastcompany-com-91520702-y-combinator-garry-tan-agentic-ai-social-media","duplicate_status":"new","dupl