{"id":"2026-07-08-21","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T14:49:47.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"Elvis Saravia 通过 HITL 和 DialAgent 提升 agentic loops 可靠性","original_url":"https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2074506169352180108","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrasc88300h6ihog8mwnmob9","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：Elvis Saravia (@omarsar0, DAIR.AI)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrasc88300h6ihog8mwnmob9","aihot_summary":"Elvis Saravia 介绍使用 human-in-the-loop（HITL）来提升 agentic loops 的可靠性。他所有 Claude 和 Codex agent 会话都通过 @DialAgent MCP 服务器，该服务器为 agent 提供专属号码，支持语音、SMS、iMessage 作为原生工具。当循环/自动化处理 PR 或新功能时，agent 会通过简短电话将决策升级给人类，尤其适合在路上或离开电脑时。用户可粘贴指令让 agent 拨打电话测试。DialAgent 提供 $5 免费额度：http://getdial.ai","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"HITL 升级通道可转成 agent 失败/确认机制设计练习。","display_summary":"Elvis Saravia 介绍使用 human-in-the-loop（HITL）来提升 agentic loops 的可靠性。他所有 Claude 和 Codex agent 会话都通过 @DialAgent MCP 服务器，该服务器为 agent 提供专属号码，支持语音、SMS、iMessage 作为原生工具。当循环/自动化处理 PR 或新功能时，agent 会通过简短电话将决策升级给人类，尤其适合在路上或离开电脑时。用户可粘贴指令让 agent 拨打电话测试。DialAgent 提供 $5 免费额度：http://getdial.ai","summary":"Elvis Saravia 介绍使用 human-in-the-loop（HITL）来提升 agentic loops 的可靠性。他所有 Claude 和 Codex agent 会话都通过 @DialAgent MCP 服务器，该服务器为 agent 提供专属号码，支持语音、SMS、iMessage 作为原生工具。当循环/自动化处理 PR 或新功能时，agent 会通过简短电话将决策升级给人类，尤其适合在路上或离开电脑时。用户可粘贴指令让 agent 拨打电话测试。DialAgent 提供 $5 免费额度：http://getdial.ai","why_it_matters":"HITL 升级通道可转成 agent 失败/确认机制设计练习。","priority":"P1","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"https-x-com-omarsar0-status-2074506169352180108","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"HITL 升级通道可转成 agent 失败/确认机制设计练习。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"reachable","url_checked_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B / AI PM / agent workflow / portfolio","proof_artifact":"mini spec / teardown / checklist","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":""}
{"id":"2026-07-08-22","date":"2026-07-08","published_at":"2026-07-07T14:21:59.722Z","observed_at":"2026-07-08T17:45:00+08:00","title":"在 Claude Code 中选择 Claude 模型与努力级别","original_url":"https://claude.com/blog/claude-model-and-effort-level-in-claude-code","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmraqmpst004cihogf6nqkgvh","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; non-AIhot supplements added separately from official/GitHub primary sources.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmraqmpst004cihogf6nqkgvh","aihot_summary":"Claude Code 提供模型（model）和努力级别（effort）两种设置。模型选择决定能力范围，更大模型（如 Claude Fable 5）在基准上优于 Claude Sonnet。努力级别不单是思考时间，还控制读取文件数、验证步骤及多步任务的推进深度。较高努力下 Claude 会自行读取文件、运行测试并复核；较低努力则更倾向请求用户提供上下文。若 Claude 已掌握上下文但仍出错，应换更强大模型；若因跳读文件或未运行测试而出错，则应提高努力级别。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"model/effort 选择直接影响个人全栈开发工作流质量。","display_summary":"Claude Code 提供模型（model）和努力级别（effort）两种设置。模型选择决定能力范围，更大模型（如 Claude Fable 5）在基准上优于 Claude Sonnet。努力级别不单是思考时间，还控制读取文件数、验证步骤及多步任务的推进深度。较高努力下 Claude 会自行读取文件、运行测试并复核；较低努力则更倾向请求用户提供上下文。若 Claude 已掌握上下文但仍出错，应换更强大模型；若因跳读文件或未运行测试而出错，则应提高努力级别。","summary":"Claude Code 提供模型（model）和努力级别（effort）两种设置。模型选择决定能力范围，更大模型（如 Claude Fable 5）在基准上优于 Claude Sonnet。努力级别不单是思考时间，还控制读取文件数、验证步骤及多步任务的推进深度。较高努力下 Claude 会自行读取文件、运行测试并复核；较低努力则更倾向请求用户提供上下文。若 Claude 已掌握上下文但仍出错，应换更强大模型；若因跳读文件或未运行测试而出错，则应提高努力级别。","why_it_matters":"model/effort 选择直接影响个人全栈开发工作流质量。","priority":"P1","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"https-claude-com-blog-claude-model-and-effort-level-in-claude-code","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":