{"id":"2026-07-09-02","date":"2026-07-09","published_at":"2026-07-09T14:01:03.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-09T23:45:00+08:00","title":"TeXada：基于MiniCPM的本地数学Agent发布","original_url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2075218678027850154","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrdl9o8g04twih4b0sqb2p2d","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; arXiv supplemental raw was available and GitHub supplemental prefetch was skipped.","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrdl9o8g04twih4b0sqb2p2d","aihot_summary":"社区开发者基于MiniCPM5-1B和MiniCPM-V 4.6构建了本地优先的数学智能体TeXada。该Agent支持自然语言直接转LaTeX、手写/图像公式OCR转可编辑LaTeX、LaTeX补全与错误修复等核心功能。所有推理在本地完成，无需依赖云服务，保障隐私安全，适用于学生、研究人员和开发者随时随地处理数学表达式。已开源至GitHub，并提供HuggingFace模型下载。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"TeXada 是本地优先小模型应用案例，适合作为轻量 AI 工具产品形态观察。","display_summary":"社区开发者基于MiniCPM5-1B和MiniCPM-V 4.6构建了本地优先的数学智能体TeXada。该Agent支持自然语言直接转LaTeX、手写/图像公式OCR转可编辑LaTeX、LaTeX补全与错误修复等核心功能。所有推理在本地完成，无需依赖云服务，保障隐私安全，适用于学生、研究人员和开发者随时随地处理数学表达式。已开源至GitHub，并提供HuggingFace模型下载。","summary":"社区开发者基于MiniCPM5-1B和MiniCPM-V 4.6构建了本地优先的数学智能体TeXada。该Agent支持自然语言直接转LaTeX、手写/图像公式OCR转可编辑LaTeX、LaTeX补全与错误修复等核心功能。所有推理在本地完成，无需依赖云服务，保障隐私安全，适用于学生、研究人员和开发者随时随地处理数学表达式。已开源至GitHub，并提供HuggingFace模型下载。","why_it_matters":"开源和本地隐私特征有实践价值，但原始链接是 X，需人工确认仓库入口。","priority":"P1","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"x-com-openbmb-status-2075218678027850154","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"开源和本地隐私特征有实践价值，但原始链接是 X，需人工确认仓库入口。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_stat