{"id":"2026-07-10-03","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-10T01:45:26.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Claude Code v2.1.206 发布","original_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.206","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmreax6su01ozihyy4xtirms5","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Claude Code：GitHub Releases（RSS）","source_type":"github_release","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"github_release","aihot_id":"cmreax6su01ozihyy4xtirms5","aihot_summary":"Claude Code v2.1.206 发布，主要更新包括：为 `/cd` 命令添加目录路径建议；新增 `/doctor` 检查以建议修剪 CLAUDE.md 文件中模型可从代码库推导的内容；`/commit-push-pr` 现在自动允许 git push 到仓库配置的推送远程仓库；`/login` 支持 Anthropic 运营的公共网关端点；后台智能体在更新后自动升级。修复了过期登录导致所有模型报错、`claude --resume` 和 `--continue` 在启动时无键盘响应、MCP 服务器忽略 `request_timeout_ms` 配置、OAuth MCP 服务器需手动重新认证、`/model` 选择器价格显示错误、桌面会话卡在\"运行中\"状态、Windows 上键盘输入被忽略等多项问题。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Claude Code release provides direct cues for AI coding tool reliability and project-rules hygiene.","display_summary":"Claude Code v2.1.206 发布，主要更新包括：为 `/cd` 命令添加目录路径建议；新增 `/doctor` 检查以建议修剪 CLAUDE.md 文件中模型可从代码库推导的内容；`/commit-push-pr` 现在自动允许 git push 到仓库配置的推送远程仓库；`/login` 支持 Anthropic 运营的公共网关端点；后台智能体在更新后自动升级。修复了过期登录导致所有模型报错、`claude --resume` 和 `--continue` 在启动时无键盘响应、MCP 服务器忽略 `request_timeout_ms` 配置、OAuth MCP 服务器需手动重新认证、`/model` 选择器价格显示错误、桌面会话卡在\"运行中\"状态、Windows 上键盘输入被忽略等多项问题。","summary":"Claude Code v2.1.206 发布，主要更新包括：为 `/cd` 命令添加目录路径建议；新增 `/doctor` 检查以建议修剪 CLAUDE.md 文件中模型可从代码库推导的内容；`/commit-push-pr` 现在自动允许 git push 到仓库配置的推送远程仓库；`/login` 支持 Anthropic 运营的公共网关端点；后台智能体在更新后自动升级。修复了过期登录导致所有模型报错、`claude --resume` 和 `--continue` 在启动时无键盘响应、MCP 服务器忽略 `request_timeout_ms` 配置、OAuth MCP 服务器需手动重新认证、`/model` 选择器价格显示错误、桌面会话卡在\"运行中\"状态、Windows 上键盘输入被忽略等多项问题。","why_it_matters":"Claude Code release provides direct cues for AI coding tool reliability and project-rules hygiene.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.206","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"AI coding release with concrete usability, governance and MCP reliability details.","read_reason":"它把 AI coding 工具的体验问题具体化到目录导航、项目规则体检、MCP 和认证稳定性。","focus_direction":"关注哪些修复属于产品可用性、团队治理和 MCP 可靠性，而不只看版本号。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"Vibe Coding / workflow / portfolio","proof_artifact":"AI coding health-check checklist","validation_window":"same day","interview_story_angle":"把 release notes 转成工作台可靠性标准。","next_proof_action":"Extract 5 health-check items for AI coding agents.","reading_category":"P1 扫读"}
{"id":"2026-07-10-04","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-10T00:20:20.110Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Google Research 推出 SensorFM：面向可穿戴健康数据的通用基础模型","original_url":"https://research.google/blog/sensorfm-towards-a-general-intelligence-and-interface-for-wearable-health-data","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre6wsva00lzihyym47wp98b","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"official_blog","aihot_id":"cmre6wsva00lzihyym47wp98b","aihot_summary":"Google Research 发布 SensorFM，一个在超过 100 万亿分钟多模态传感器数据上预训练的大规模基础模型，数据来自 500 万同意参与者，涵盖 100 多个国家及 20 余款 Fitbit 和 Pixel Watch 设备。SensorFM 学习通用的人体生理表征，可迁移至心血管、代谢、睡眠、心理健康及生活方式等 35 项健康预测任务，支持标签高效适配与数据填充，并可作为个人健康智能体的基础工具。该模型旨在解决传统可穿戴健康模型针对单一终点、难以泛化的问题。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Health foundation model is a research/product boundary signal.","display_summary":"Google Research 发布 SensorFM，一个在超过 100 万亿分钟多模态传感器数据上预训练的大规模基础模型，数据来自 500 万同意参与者，涵盖 100 多个国家及 20 余款 Fitbit 和 Pixel Watch 设备。SensorFM 学习通用的人体生理表征，可迁移至心血管、代谢、睡眠、心理健康及生活方式等 35 项健康预测任务，支持标签高效适配与数据填充，并可作为个人健康智能体的基础工具。该模型旨在解决传统可穿戴健康模型针对单一终点、难以泛化的问题。","summary":"Google Research 发布 SensorFM，一个在超过 100 万亿分钟多模态传感器数据上预训练的大规模基础模型，数据来自 500 万同意参与者，涵盖 100 多个国家及 20 余款 Fitbit 和 Pixel Watch 设备。SensorFM 学习通用的人体生理表征，可迁移至心血管、代谢、睡眠、心理健康及生活方式等 35 项健康预测任务，支持标签高效适配与数据填充，并可作为个人健康智能体的基础工具。该模型旨在解决传统可穿戴健康模型针对单一终点、难以泛化的问题。","why_it_matters":"Health foundation model is a research/product boundary signal.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"research.google/blog/sensorfm-towards-a-general-intelligence-and-interface-for-wearable-health-data","duplicate_status":"new","dupl