{"id":"2026-07-10-05","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T22:18:12.902Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Show HN： 如何在我的低配置电脑上运行 GLM-5.2","original_url":"https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre3p4ne005fihrad1xjqjru","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"github_repo","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"github_repo","aihot_id":"cmre3p4ne005fihrad1xjqjru","aihot_summary":"colibrì v1.0 引擎以纯 C 实现、零运行时依赖，可在约 25 GB RAM 的消费级电脑上运行 744B 参数的 GLM-5.2 MoE 模型。模型经 int4 量化后磁盘占用约 370 GB，常驻内存仅 9.9 GB，通过流式加载磁盘专家实现推理。冷解码速度约","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Local MoE runtime is interesting but hardware footprint is high.","display_summary":"colibrì v1.0 引擎以纯 C 实现、零运行时依赖，可在约 25 GB RAM 的消费级电脑上运行 744B 参数的 GLM-5.2 MoE 模型。模型经 int4 量化后磁盘占用约 370 GB，常驻内存仅 9.9 GB，通过流式加载磁盘专家实现推理。冷解码速度约","summary":"colibrì v1.0 引擎以纯 C 实现、零运行时依赖，可在约 25 GB RAM 的消费级电脑上运行 744B 参数的 GLM-5.2 MoE 模型。模型经 int4 量化后磁盘占用约 370 GB，常驻内存仅 9.9 GB，通过流式加载磁盘专家实现推理。冷解码速度约","why_it_matters":"Local MoE runtime is interesting but hardware footprint is high.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"github.com/justvugg/colibri","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"Local MoE runtime is interesting but hardware footprint is high.","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"medium","target_role_signal":"full-stack AI builde