{"id":"2026-07-10-08","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T21:46:29.789Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"社交媒体AI生成内容泛滥：LinkedIn超过40%长文为AI写作","original_url":"https://www.pangram.com/blog/ai-in-your-feed","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre2mjan00msihwkpuxq0462","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"industry_report","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"industry_report","aihot_id":"cmre2mjan00msihwkpuxq0462","aihot_summary":"安全公司Pangram通过Chrome扩展收集超100万条帖子，分析发现社交媒体AI生成内容泛滥。整体AI检测率13.8%，长文（超250词）中25.72%完全由AI生成。LinkedIn最为严重，超40%长文帖子被标记为完全AI生成，占全部AI内容的62%；X/Twitter近一半文章（23.9%完全AI+22.9%混合）为AI写作。Reddit整体AI率仅4.4%，但顶层帖子AI率达11.6%。分析使用Pangram 3.3模型，假阳性率0.01%。Substack上长文AI率反而略低。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Content authenticity risk affects AI product trust and GTM channels.","display_summary":"安全公司Pangram通过Chrome扩展收集超100万条帖子，分析发现社交媒体AI生成内容泛滥。整体AI检测率13.8%，长文（超250词）中25.72%完全由AI生成。LinkedIn最为严重，超40%长文帖子被标记为完全AI生成，占全部AI内容的62%；X/Twitter近一半文章（23.9%完全AI+22.9%混合）为AI写作。Reddit整体AI率仅4.4%，但顶层帖子AI率达11.6%。分析使用Pangram 3.3模型，假阳性率0.01%。Substack上长文AI率反而略低。","summary":"安全公司Pangram通过Chrome扩展收集超100万条帖子，分析发现社交媒体AI生成内容泛滥。整体AI检测率13.8%，长文（超250词）中25.72%完全由AI生成。LinkedIn最为严重，超40%长文帖子被标记为完全AI生成，占全部AI内容的62%；X/Twitter近一半文章（23.9%完全AI+22.9%混合）为AI写作。Reddit整体AI率仅4.4%，但顶层帖子AI率达11.6%。分析使用Pangram 3.3模型，假阳性率0.01%。Substack上长文AI率反而略低。","why_it_matters":"Content authenticity risk affects AI product trust and GTM channels.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"pangram.com/blog/ai-in-your-feed","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","