{"id":"2026-07-10-09","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T21:46:21.422Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Bun 被 Anthropic 收购后用 Rust 重写，月下载超 2200 万","original_url":"https://bun.com/blog/bun-in-rust","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre2mjao00ncihwk7foifcuk","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"official_blog","aihot_id":"cmre2mjao00ncihwk7foifcuk","aihot_summary":"Bun 于 2025 年 12 月被 Anthropic 收购，作者使用预发布版 Claude Fable 5 进行了大量 Rust 重写。Bun 最初用 Zig 在一年内构建，如今 CLI 月下载超 2200 万，被 Claude Code 等采用。广泛功能带来稳定性挑战，v1.3.14 修复了多项 use-after-free、内存泄漏等 bug。团队通过 ASAN、Fuzzilli 模糊测试等系统性预防，并借助 Rust 的内存安全特性减少此类缺陷。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Engineering reliability story can inform AI coding toolchain judgment.","display_summary":"Bun 于 2025 年 12 月被 Anthropic 收购，作者使用预发布版 Claude Fable 5 进行了大量 Rust 重写。Bun 最初用 Zig 在一年内构建，如今 CLI 月下载超 2200 万，被 Claude Code 等采用。广泛功能带来稳定性挑战，v1.3.14 修复了多项 use-after-free、内存泄漏等 bug。团队通过 ASAN、Fuzzilli 模糊测试等系统性预防，并借助 Rust 的内存安全特性减少此类缺陷。","summary":"Bun 于 2025 年 12 月被 Anthropic 收购，作者使用预发布版 Claude Fable 5 进行了大量 Rust 重写。Bun 最初用 Zig 在一年内构建，如今 CLI 月下载超 2200 万，被 Claude Code 等采用。广泛功能带来稳定性挑战，v1.3.14 修复了多项 use-after-free、内存泄漏等 bug。团队通过 ASAN、Fuzzilli 模糊测试等系统性预防，并借助 Rust 的内存安全特性减少此类缺陷。","why_it_matters":"Engineering reliability story can inform AI coding toolchain judgment.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"bun.com/blog/bun-in-rust","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"Engineering reliability story can inform AI coding toolcha