{"id":"2026-07-10-10","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T21:46:19.253Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"微软发布Flint：面向AI智能体的可视化语言","original_url":"https://microsoft.github.io/flint-chart","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre2mjao00nmihwkz4nz0e46","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"industry_report","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"industry_report","aihot_id":"cmre2mjao00nmihwkz4nz0e46","aihot_summary":"微软研究院推出Flint，一种可视化中间语言，让AI智能体通过简洁的人类可编辑spec自动生成美观图表。用户只需提供数据、语义类型和图表类型，Flint编译器即可推导坐标轴、配色、布局等底层参数。支持46种图表类型，可渲染到Vega-Lite、ECharts和Chart.js三个后端。项目通过npm安装（TypeScript/JavaScript），并提供MCP服务器用于智能体工作流集成。采用弹性布局模型自动优化图表尺寸与间距，已开源。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Flint offers a small spec-to-chart replication path and a concrete MCP integration idea.","display_summary":"微软研究院推出Flint，一种可视化中间语言，让AI智能体通过简洁的人类可编辑spec自动生成美观图表。用户只需提供数据、语义类型和图表类型，Flint编译器即可推导坐标轴、配色、布局等底层参数。支持46种图表类型，可渲染到Vega-Lite、ECharts和Chart.js三个后端。项目通过npm安装（TypeScript/JavaScript），并提供MCP服务器用于智能体工作流集成。采用弹性布局模型自动优化图表尺寸与间距，已开源。","summary":"微软研究院推出Flint，一种可视化中间语言，让AI智能体通过简洁的人类可编辑spec自动生成美观图表。用户只需提供数据、语义类型和图表类型，Flint编译器即可推导坐标轴、配色、布局等底层参数。支持46种图表类型，可渲染到Vega-Lite、ECharts和Chart.js三个后端。项目通过npm安装（TypeScript/JavaScript），并提供MCP服务器用于智能体工作流集成。采用弹性布局模型自动优化图表尺寸与间距，已开源。","why_it_matters":"Flint offers a small spec-to-chart replication path and a concrete MCP integration idea.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"microsoft.github.io/flint-chart","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"Spec-based chart generation is directly replicable and useful for PM reporting workflows.","read_reason":"它把智能体生成图表的过程拆成数据、语义类型、图表类型和可编辑 spec。","focus_direction":"关注 spec 可编辑性、多后端渲染和 MCP 接入如何降低 AI 生成图表的验收成本。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"AI PM / Vibe Coding / portfolio","proof_artifact":"chart spec mini-demo","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"把 AI 图表生成从黑盒 prompt 变成可验收 spec。","next_proof_action":"Create one chart spec with acceptance criteria.","reading_category":"GitHub 热门或可复刻项目"}
{"id":"2026-07-10-11","date":"2026-07-10","published_at":"2026-07-09T21:46:17.901Z","observed_at":"2026-07-10T03:56:26Z","title":"Cognition 推出 SWE-1.7，接近 GPT 5.5 与 Opus 智能水平","original_url":"https://cognition.com/blog/swe-1-7","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmre2mjao00nrihwkhnv9ahqj","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","original_format":"official_blog","aihot_id":"cmre2mjao00nrihwkhnv9ahqj","aihot_summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"Coding-agent benchmark and cost claims need primary benchmark review.","display_summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","summary":"Cognition 发布迄今最强模型 SWE-1.7，基于 Kimi K2.7 基座训练，通过强化学习管线改进（基础设施、训练稳定性、数据质量、长程任务技术）实现前沿智能水平并大幅降低成本。在 FrontierCode 1.1 Main 基准上达 42.3%（Kimi K2.7 Code 为 30.1%，GPT-5.5 为 43.0%，Opus 4.8 为 46.5%），Terminal-Bench 2.1 达 81.5%，SWE-Bench Multilingual 达 77.8%。模型针对长周期异步任务优化，现已在 Devin（Web、桌面、CLI）通过 Cerebras 以 1000 TPS 提供。","why_it_matters":"Coding-agent benchmark and cost claims need primary benchmark review.","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"candidate","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_k