{"id":"2026-07-11-05","date":"2026-07-11","published_at":"2026-07-10T17:19:11.037Z","observed_at":"2026-07-11T09:27:49+08:00","title":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 强化学习训练登陆 AMD Instinct MI355X GPU，由 Miles 框架支持","original_url":"https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-07-10-rocm-miles-dsv4","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrf7a5kg000wihpr80vvnaxn","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"LMSYS：Blog（Chatbot Arena 团队）","source_type":"paper","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified; supplemental raw mapped separately when available.","original_format":"paper","aihot_id":"cmrf7a5kg000wihpr80vvnaxn","aihot_summary":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 的强化学习训练现已在 AMD Instinct MI355X GPU 上通过 Miles 框架获得支持，基于 ROCm 软件栈运行。该 2840 亿参数 MoE 模型（每 token 激活 130 亿参数）需 SGLang 进行 rollout 生成、Megatron 进行策略更新，Miles 负责异步循环与权重同步。团队解决了 SGLang 与 Megatron 间模型对齐、量化状态在线更新及多节点并行稳定性三大挑战，最终在四个八 GPU 节点上完成端到端验证：超过 100 个优化器步骤中训练-rollout 对数概率差可控，在线奖励持续提升，离线 AIME-2024 基准分数同步上涨。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 在 AMD GPU 上的强化学习训练信号，关系到训练基础设施多元化和成本弹性。","display_summary":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 的强化学习训练现已在 AMD Instinct MI355X GPU 上通过 Miles 框架获得支持，基于 ROCm 软件栈运行。该 2840 亿参数 MoE 模型（每 token 激活 130 亿参数）需 SGLang 进行 rollout 生成、Megatron 进行策略更新，Miles 负责异步循环与权重同步。团队解决了 SGLang 与 Megatron 间模型对齐、量化状态在线更新及多节点并行稳定性三大挑战，最终在四个八 GPU 节点上完成端到端验证：超过 100 个优化器步骤中训练-rollout 对数概率差可控，在线奖励持续提升，离线 AIME-2024 基准分数同步上涨。","summary":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 的强化学习训练现已在 AMD Instinct MI355X GPU 上通过 Miles 框架获得支持，基于 ROCm 软件栈运行。该 2840 亿参数 MoE 模型（每 token 激活 130 亿参数）需 SGLang 进行 rollout 生成、Megatron 进行策略更新，Miles 负责异步循环与权重同步。团队解决了 SGLang 与 Megatron 间模型对齐、量化状态在线更新及多节点并行稳定性三大挑战，最终在四个八 GPU 节点上完成端到端验证：超过 100 个优化器步骤中训练-rollout 对数概率差可控，在线奖励持续提升，离线 AIME-2024 基准分数同步上涨。","why_it_matters":"DeepSeek-V4 Flash 在 AMD GPU 上的强化学习训练信号，关系到训练基础设施多元化和成本弹性。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"lmsys.org/blog/2026-07-10-rocm-miles-dsv4","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"官方/团队博客型来源，适合扫读其训练框架、硬件和性能口径。","read_reason":"它把模型训练进展和 AMD 加速生态连在一起，适合补足 AI 基建判断。","focus_direction":"关注 Miles 框架、AMD Instinct MI355X、训练阶段和可复现证据，而不是只记模型名。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","tags":[],"interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"AI PM / workflow automation / product risk","proof_artifact":"candidate note","validation_window":"1-3 days","interview_story_angle":"","next_proof_action":"","reading_category":"P1 扫读"}
