{"id":"2026-07-12-03","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"2026-07-11T16:46:22.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-5.6 系列医疗评估结果","original_url":"https://x.com/sama/status/2075985056846451123","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrglvcki024uih2edvsk7pef","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：Sam Altman (@sama)","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified.","original_format":"article","aihot_id":"cmrglvcki024uih2edvsk7pef","aihot_summary":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-5.6 系列在医疗领域的评估结果。最小变体 GPT-5.6 Luna 在最低推理强度下即超越最高推理强度的 GPT-5.5，且成本低 25 倍；最大变体 GPT-5.6 Sol 树立新标杆。在涵盖患者端与临床端的多样化任务中，专科医生被要求以无限时间和网络访问权限撰写回答，随后由其他医生盲评。评估基于准确性、沟通、完整性、指令遵循及健康决策帮助性五个维度，共 20000 次评分。结果显示，所有 GPT-5.6 模型表现均显著优于医生，且医生发现 GPT-5.6 回答中的缺陷少于医生自己撰写的回答。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-5.6 系列在医疗领域的评估结果。最小变体 GPT-5.6 Luna 在最低推理强度下即超越最高推理强度的 GPT-5.5，且成本低 25 倍；最大变体 GPT-5.6 Sol 树立新标杆。在涵盖患者端与临床端的多样化任务中，专科医生被要求以无限时间和网络访问权限撰写回答，随后由其他医生盲评。评估基于准确性、沟通、完整性、指令遵循及健康决策帮助性五个维度，共 20000 次评分。结果显示，所有 GPT-5.6 模型表现均显著优于医生，且医生发现 GPT-5.6 回答中的缺陷少于医生自己撰写的回答。","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"x.com/sama/status/2075985056846451123","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"今日预取首次出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"医疗评估同时涉及模型能力、成本和高风险基准设计。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"可获得模型变体、推理强度、成本差异、盲评设置、评分维度与评分规模等发布信息。","open_questions":"需额外核验完整评测报告、样本构成、医生基线、公平性、统计显著性与临床部署边界。","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-12-04","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"2026-07-11T16:31:09.615Z","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"Ghost Font：一种人类能读懂但AI无法识别的反AI字体","original_url":"https://www.mixfont.com/ghost-font","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrglsyla01zoih2enmsl2eu8","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified.","original_format":"article","aihot_id":"cmrglsyla01zoih2enmsl2eu8","aihot_summary":"Ghost Font 是一种利用运动、视频、噪点和诱饵来隐藏文字的反AI字体。用户输入文字后可生成并下载视频片段，视频中的字母由与背景完全相同的点组成，单帧截图无法显示任何信息。该字体生成的视频被传递给Claude Fable和GPT Sol 5.6 Ultra等前沿模型时，这些模型即使具备编程能力也无法解码移动信息，直到被提示具体技术。视频中还包含一条诱饵信息，使模型误以为找到真实内容。项目灵感来自2013年Sang Mun设计的ZXX字体，但现代AI已能轻松读取ZXX。Ghost Font目前为本地原型，数据不发送至任何服务器。作者计划未来将视频生成代码开源，并探索将其用于CAPTCHA系统或AI视觉感知基准测试。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Ghost Font 是一种利用运动、视频、噪点和诱饵来隐藏文字的反AI字体。用户输入文字后可生成并下载视频片段，视频中的字母由与背景完全相同的点组成，单帧截图无法显示任何信息。该字体生成的视频被传递给Claude Fable和GPT Sol 5.6 Ultra等前沿模型时，这些模型即使具备编程能力也无法解码移动信息，直到被提示具体技术。视频中还包含一条诱饵信息，使模型误以为找到真实内容。项目灵感来自2013年Sang Mun设计的ZXX字体，但现代AI已能轻松读取ZXX。Ghost Font目前为本地原型，数据不发送至任何服务器。作者计划未来将视频生成代码开源，并探索将其用于CAPTCHA系统或AI视觉感知基准测试。","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"mixfont.com/ghost-font","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"今日预取首次出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"可转成小型多模态鲁棒性测试，产出可展示结果。","read_reason":"它提供一个低成本复刻的视觉对抗样例，适合训练 AI PM 的评测设计能力。","focus_direction":"关注输入扰动、诱饵信息、模型失败条件与可复现测试集的设计。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-12-07","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"2026-07-11T01:56:54.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"OpenAI GPT-5.6-Sol 删光 AI 创业者 Matt Shumer 的 Mac 硬盘","original_url":"https://x.com/AYi_AInotes/status/2075761215251312722","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrfr2xvi02brihjlp1tlzg1n","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：阿易 AI Notes (@AYi_AInotes)","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"main_aihot: AIhot Public API verified.","original_format":"article","aihot_id":"cmrfr2xvi02brihjlp1tlzg1n","aihot_summary":"知名 AI 创业者 Matt Shumer 的 Mac 硬盘被 OpenAI 最新 Agent 模型 GPT-5.6-Sol 彻底清空。他在本地 Agent 上开启 Full Access 权限，让 subagent 执行文件清理任务，结果 shell 变量 $HOME 路径解析错误，Agent 直接执行 `rm -rf /Users/mattsdevbox`，导致数年代码、文件、照片丢失。该任务此前已安全运行数百次。事后 Agent 自动生成事故报告承认错误。Matt 表示\"1000x 更信任 Anthropic 的 Fable\"。事件暴露 Agent 行业核心风险：顶级模型仍会在变量展开、路径等细节翻车；Subagent + 长时自主运行 + 全权限构成灾难放大器；模型厂商安全底线差异巨大。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"知名 AI 创业者 Matt Shumer 的 Mac 硬盘被 OpenAI 最新 Agent 模型 GPT-5.6-Sol 彻底清空。他在本地 Agent 上开启 Full Access 权限，让 subagent 执行文件清理任务，结果 shell 变量 $HOME 路径解析错误，Agent 直接执行 `rm -rf /Users/mattsdevbox`，导致数年代码、文件、照片丢失。该任务此前已安全运行数百次。事后 Agent 自动生成事故报告承认错误。Matt 表示\"1000x 更信任 Anthropic 的 Fable\"。事件暴露 Agent 行业核心风险：顶级模型仍会在变量展开、路径等细节翻车；Subagent + 长时自主运行 + 全权限构成灾难放大器；模型厂商安全底线差异巨大。","priority":"P0","confidence":"low","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"x.com/ayi_ainotes/status/2075761215251312722","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"今日预取首次出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"单一社交来源但直指 Agent 文件权限与不可逆操作风险。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"可获得事件当事人转述的操作结果与模型使用情境。","open_questions":"需额外核验原始当事人记录、权限配置、确认流程、备份状态、工具调用日志及厂商回应。","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-12-08","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"2026-07-09T07:53:52Z","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"affaan-m/ECC","original_url":"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC","source_url":"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"GitHub","source_type":"github_repo","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"github_search_supplement","original_format":"github_repo","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"The agent harness performance optimization system. Skills, instincts, memory, security, and research-first development for Claude Code, Codex, Opencode, Cursor and beyond.","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"The agent harness performance optimization system. Skills, instincts, memory, security, and research-first development for Claude Code, Codex, Opencode, Cursor and beyond.","priority":"P0","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"github.com/affaan-m/ecc","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"今日预取首次出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"直接对应多 Agent harness、技能、记忆与安全工作流，可形成小型复刻。","read_reason":"它把 Agent harness 优化拆成技能、记忆、安全与研究优先流程，适合与你的文件驱动工作台对照。","focus_direction":"关注最小安装路径、可观测指标、记忆写入边界和安全控制是否能独立复用。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox","entry_barrier":"low","minimum_replication_scope":"选一个 memory 或 security 机制，在 CortexOps 中做 1-3 小时最小对照实验。","first_action_within_30_minutes":"阅读 README，列出可单独复刻的三个机制并选一个。","portfolio_potential":"high","why_it_matches_current_stage":"能形成 AI PM 工作流判断、Vibe Coding 实践和可展示实验记录。"}
{"id":"2026-07-12-30","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"2026-07-09T17:47:08Z","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"Dimensionality Reduction Meets Network Science: Sensemaking on UMAP's kNN Graph","original_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08746","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08746","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"paper","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"arxiv_export_supplement","original_format":"paper","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"While UMAP is widely used for exploring high-dimensional data, typical workflows focus on its lower-dimensional embedding, largely overlooking the rich k-nearest-neighbor (kNN) graph that UMAP constructs internally. This graph encodes the data manifold in its original high-dimensional space, before the distortion that UMAP's 2D projection introduces. We demonstrate the untapped potential of this internal representation, showing how standard graph algorithms applied to this graph enhance data sensemaking: (1) PageRank identifies representative data points, (2) k-core decomposition reveals dense core regions versus sparse periphery, and (3) clustering coefficient detects tight-knit neighborhoods with highly-similar data points. Through quantitative and qualitative evaluation on MNIST and Fashion MNIST, we show that these graph-based analyses are not only practical but also competitive with or complementary to purpose-built methods (e.g., k-medoids for exemplar selection, HDBSCAN for density-based clustering).","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"While UMAP is widely used for exploring high-dimensional data, typical workflows focus on its lower-dimensional embedding, largely overlooking the rich k-nearest-neighbor (kNN) graph that UMAP constructs internally. This graph encodes the data manifold in its original high-dimensional space, before the distortion that UMAP's 2D projection introduces. We demonstrate the untapped potential of this internal representation, showing how standard graph algorithms applied to this graph enhance data sensemaking: (1) PageRank identifies representative data points, (2) k-core decomposition reveals dense core regions versus sparse periphery, and (3) clustering coefficient detects tight-knit neighborhoods with highly-similar data points. Through quantitative and qualitative evaluation on MNIST and Fashion MNIST, we show that these graph-based analyses are not only practical but also competitive with or complementary to purpose-built methods (e.g., k-medoids for exemplar selection, HDBSCAN for density-based clustering).","priority":"P1","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"arxiv.org/abs/2607.08746","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"今日预取首次出现。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"面向 UMAP 邻接图的可解释性研究可补足 AI PM 的降维图表判断。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"可获得论文对 UMAP kNN 图与网络科学 sensemaking 方法的研究问题、方法和实验结论。","open_questions":"需额外研究该方法对真实产品埋点、聚类命名、交互解释和非技术用户决策是否有效。","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-12-43","date":"2026-07-12","published_at":"","observed_at":"2026-07-12T01:15:36Z","title":"正式练习：Agent Harness 最小机制对照卡","original_url":"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC#practice","source_url":"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC#practice","source_origin":"primary","source_name":"CortexOps","source_type":"personal_work","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","source_mix_note":"daily_practice: based on selected ECC GitHub signal","original_format":"personal_work","aihot_id":"","aihot_summary":"","aihot_summary_status":"not_applicable","discovery_summary":"正式练习：20-45 分钟从 ECC 的技能、记忆、安全或研究流程中选一个机制，与 CortexOps 当前做法完成最小对照卡。","codex_summary":"把今日 GitHub 工程信号转成可展示的 Agent harness 产品判断。","display_summary":"正式练习：20-45 分钟从 ECC 的技能、记忆、安全或研究流程中选一个机制，与 CortexOps 当前做法完成最小对照卡。","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"github.com/affaan-m/ecc#practice","duplicate_status":"new","novelty_reason":"基于今日首次出现的 ECC 项目生成正式练习。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"正式练习可在当天形成面试与作品集证明。","read_reason":"它把 Agent harness 方法转成与你现有系统的具体差异。","focus_direction":"关注机制目标、状态文件、触发条件、风险控制和可验证指标。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","requires_manual_review":true,"status":"inbox","interview_relevance":"high","target_role_signal":"2B AI PM / Vibe Coding / rapid validation / portfolio","proof_artifact":"Agent Harness 最小机制对照卡","validation_window":"same day","interview_story_angle":"把外部 Agent harness 方法快速转成自己系统的可验证改进判断。","next_proof_action":"完成一张机制对照表并决定 adopt、adapt 或 reject。"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-01","date":"2026-07-13","title":"黄仁勋：英伟达季度收入逼近千亿美元，Rubin Ultra 架构未延期","original_url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/975/865.htm","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrijw1sy00j6bi0jshweyv4l","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"ithome.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmrijw1sy00j6bi0jshweyv4l","aihot_summary":"英伟达CEO黄仁勋在摩根士丹利路演中表示，公司季度营收即将逼近1000亿美元，且增长速度仍在加快。他否认下一代旗舰架构Rubin Ultra延期传闻，称其仍按计划于明年出货，当前机架设计调整仅为系统架构优化。一个此前主要依赖ASIC的前沿AI模型项目，如今英伟达GPU算力占比已接近50%，市场普遍指向Anthropic。英伟达预计本财年CPU业务收入约200亿美元，下一代Vera CPU将进军通用服务器市场。摩根士丹利维持英伟达\"增持\"评级，目标价288美元。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"英伟达CEO黄仁勋在摩根士丹利路演中表示，公司季度营收即将逼近1000亿美元，且增长速度仍在加快。他否认下一代旗舰架构Rubin Ultra延期传闻，称其仍按计划于明年出货，当前机架设计调整仅为系统架构优化。一个此前主要依赖ASIC的前沿AI模型项目，如今英伟达GPU算力占比已接近50%，市场普遍指向Anthropic。英伟达预计本财年CPU业务收入约200亿美元，下一代Vera CPU将进军通用服务器市场。摩根士丹利维持英伟达\"增持\"评级，目标价288美元。","published_at":"2026-07-13T00:55:29.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"ithome.com/0/975/865.htm","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"low","reason":"算力平台路线与收入规模是产业背景信号，但来源为媒体转述，适合扫读。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-02","date":"2026-07-13","title":"xAI 官方 Grok CLI 被曝静默上传整个代码库及用户密钥","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6c6vGMJAVMbh6UhNVw4dcg","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmriguktg00arbijpt0l7c2vh","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"mp.weixin.qq.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmriguktg00arbijpt0l7c2vh","aihot_summary":"安全研究者发现，xAI 官方 Grok CLI（npm 包 `@xai-official/grok` 0.2.93 版）会在每轮任务前后，将当前工作目录打包为 `before_codebase.tar.gz` 和 `after_codebase.tar.gz`，通过独立旁路通道静默上传至 xAI 的 Google Cloud 仓库。验证显示，即使模型仅回复一个单词，上传依然发生。上传包还包含仓库外的 `~/.claude.json`、Claude Code 设置、全局 AGENTS 规则、30 多个 Skill 文件及一个 API 密钥。7 月 13 日凌晨，xAI 通过服务端远程开关新增 `disable_codebase_upload` 字段，将默认上传行为关闭，但此前该功能默认开启。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"安全研究者发现，xAI 官方 Grok CLI（npm 包 `@xai-official/grok` 0.2.93 版）会在每轮任务前后，将当前工作目录打包为 `before_codebase.tar.gz` 和 `after_codebase.tar.gz`，通过独立旁路通道静默上传至 xAI 的 Google Cloud 仓库。验证显示，即使模型仅回复一个单词，上传依然发生。上传包还包含仓库外的 `~/.claude.json`、Claude Code 设置、全局 AGENTS 规则、30 多个 Skill 文件及一个 API 密钥。7 月 13 日凌晨，xAI 通过服务端远程开关新增 `disable_codebase_upload` 字段，将默认上传行为关闭，但此前该功能默认开启。","published_at":"2026-07-13T00:05:00.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6c6vgmjavmbh6uhnvw4dcg","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"编码代理的数据边界与密钥泄漏风险直接影响企业采购、权限设计和信任。","priority_rationale":"该报道涉及代码库、密钥和本地配置的潜在外传，属于编码代理必须优先核查的安全信号。","pool_rationale":"当前只有二手披露且缺少官方事故说明，需要后续核实版本、默认行为和修复范围。","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-03","date":"2026-07-13","title":"Ploy 将 AI 智能体默认模型从 Claude Opus 4.8 切换至 GPT-5.6 Sol","original_url":"https://ploy.ai/blog/migrating-a-production-ai-agent-to-gpt-5-6","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrig9mkx0024bijp9pr04hss","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"ploy.ai","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmrig9mkx0024bijp9pr04hss","aihot_summary":"Ploy 将其 AI 智能体默认模型从 Claude Opus 4.8 切换至 OpenAI 今晨发布的 GPT-5.6 Sol。在真实营销网站构建测试中，GPT-5.6 Sol 完成页面平均耗时 3 分 42 秒，较 Opus 4.8 的 8 分钟快 2.2 倍；每次构建成本从 3.06 美元降至 2.22 美元，降低 27%；输出 token 从 33.0K 降至 17.1K，视觉评分从 0.936 提升至 0.970。迁移过程发现，GPT-5.6 会为所有 25 个工具参数填充默认值，导致 52%-64% 的文件读取返回空结果；提示词指令和 OpenAI strict 模式均无法修复此行为。此外，评估框架中约三分之一的原始失败源于针对旧模型的假设，而非模型本身问题。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Ploy 将其 AI 智能体默认模型从 Claude Opus 4.8 切换至 OpenAI 今晨发布的 GPT-5.6 Sol。在真实营销网站构建测试中，GPT-5.6 Sol 完成页面平均耗时 3 分 42 秒，较 Opus 4.8 的 8 分钟快 2.2 倍；每次构建成本从 3.06 美元降至 2.22 美元，降低 27%；输出 token 从 33.0K 降至 17.1K，视觉评分从 0.936 提升至 0.970。迁移过程发现，GPT-5.6 会为所有 25 个工具参数填充默认值，导致 52%-64% 的文件读取返回空结果；提示词指令和 OpenAI strict 模式均无法修复此行为。此外，评估框架中约三分之一的原始失败源于针对旧模型的假设，而非模型本身问题。","published_at":"2026-07-12T23:41:11.951Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"product_inspiration","candidate_pool":"product_inspiration","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"product_inspiration","canonical_key":"ploy.ai/blog/migrating-a-production-ai-agent-to-gpt-5-6","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"真实生产迁移同时提供速度、成本、质量与工具调用兼容性证据。","priority_rationale":"此文包含生产基准、迁移故障和评估框架反思，具备 P0 深读的信息密度。","pool_rationale":"模型迁移评估矩阵和失败归因方式可直接转化为 AI 产品设计与验收灵感。","read_reason":"可学习如何把模型切换从主观偏好变成速度、成本、质量和工具行为的可验证决策。","focus_direction":"关注评测集是否绑定旧模型假设，以及工具参数语义如何进入回归测试。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-04","date":"2026-07-13","title":"Codex与ChatGPT Work多项更新：取消5小时限制","original_url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2076365965915467978","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmri4o4kx00qcbi3hqxj8rxqd","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"x.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmri4o4kx00qcbi3hqxj8rxqd","aihot_summary":"早上好。过去48小时里，Codex和ChatGPT Work非常忙碌！三项重要更新：\n\n- 暂时取消所有Plus、Business和Pro计划的5小时使用限制\n- 正在推出变更，使GPT 5.6 Sol整体更高效，这将体现在使用量减少上，从而让你能走得更远。具体影响待量化后公布\n- 我们已达到600万活跃用户，并将在接下来一小时内进行使用量重置\n\n去创造吧。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"早上好。过去48小时里，Codex和ChatGPT Work非常忙碌！三项重要更新：\n\n- 暂时取消所有Plus、Business和Pro计划的5小时使用限制\n- 正在推出变更，使GPT 5.6 Sol整体更高效，这将体现在使用量减少上，从而让你能走得更远。具体影响待量化后公布\n- 我们已达到600万活跃用户，并将在接下来一小时内进行使用量重置\n\n去创造吧。","published_at":"2026-07-12T17:59:57.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"x.com/thsottiaux/status/2076365965915467978","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"使用限制和效率调整影响个人开发者工作流，但来源信息较短。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-05","date":"2026-07-13","title":"腾讯混元发布Hy3模型：295B参数MoE架构，Agent向LLM定位，已集成微信服务10亿+用户","original_url":"https://x.com/AYi_AInotes/status/2076341952023310580","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmri0lo1e00irbixecx7cj2f5","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"x.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmri0lo1e00irbixecx7cj2f5","aihot_summary":"腾讯混元团队发布Hy3模型，采用295B总参数、21B激活参数的MoE架构，推理效率可打平参数规模2-5倍的旗舰模型。Hy3定位为Agent向LLM，从preview到正式版基于50多个真实业务反馈迭代，内部WorkBuddy任务成功率从72%提升至90%，耗时降低34%，幻觉和常识错误持续下降。实测显示其在coding、办公、复杂任务规划方面表现突出，纯视觉能力为短板。Hy3已集成至微信服务10亿+用户，视频演示包括生成HTML网页、Agent网页和10页PPT，模型具备自检和主动说明不足的能力。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"腾讯混元团队发布Hy3模型，采用295B总参数、21B激活参数的MoE架构，推理效率可打平参数规模2-5倍的旗舰模型。Hy3定位为Agent向LLM，从preview到正式版基于50多个真实业务反馈迭代，内部WorkBuddy任务成功率从72%提升至90%，耗时降低34%，幻觉和常识错误持续下降。实测显示其在coding、办公、复杂任务规划方面表现突出，纯视觉能力为短板。Hy3已集成至微信服务10亿+用户，视频演示包括生成HTML网页、Agent网页和10页PPT，模型具备自检和主动说明不足的能力。","published_at":"2026-07-12T16:24:32.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"x.com/ayi_ainotes/status/2076341952023310580","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"国产 Agent 向模型的业务指标值得关注，但需补充官方模型卡和评测证据。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-06","date":"2026-07-13","title":"纳德拉提出\"反向信息悖论\"：企业使用AI时需保护自身知识","original_url":"https://x.com/satyanadella/status/2076323181154230284","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrhyer8a01q3biidlr8xr6rm","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"x.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmrhyer8a01q3biidlr8xr6rm","aihot_summary":"微软CEO萨提亚·纳德拉提出\"反向信息悖论\"：AI时代，买家为使用AI支付金钱，同时必须暴露专有知识（提示词、工具使用、纠正反馈等），这些\"智力废气\"被模型学习，导致信息不对称向卖家倾斜。企业需要真正的信任边界，确保自身数据、痕迹、评估、适配权重和记忆在边界内积累，未经同意不得外泄。纳德拉呼吁企业拥有私有评估、保留组织记忆所有权，并主张企业应有权使用模型输出微调或训练自有模型，以控制自身学习循环。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"微软CEO萨提亚·纳德拉提出\"反向信息悖论\"：AI时代，买家为使用AI支付金钱，同时必须暴露专有知识（提示词、工具使用、纠正反馈等），这些\"智力废气\"被模型学习，导致信息不对称向卖家倾斜。企业需要真正的信任边界，确保自身数据、痕迹、评估、适配权重和记忆在边界内积累，未经同意不得外泄。纳德拉呼吁企业拥有私有评估、保留组织记忆所有权，并主张企业应有权使用模型输出微调或训练自有模型，以控制自身学习循环。","published_at":"2026-07-12T15:09:57.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"product_inspiration","candidate_pool":"product_inspiration","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"product_inspiration","canonical_key":"x.com/satyanadella/status/2076323181154230284","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"企业知识、评估和记忆的所有权可转化为 2B AI 产品信任边界设计。","priority_rationale":"该观点直指企业 AI 采购的知识产权与学习闭环，列为 P1 观点扫读。","pool_rationale":"私有评估、组织记忆和适配权重所有权可形成 2B 产品权限与治理灵感。","read_reason":"可帮助建立企业 AI 产品中数据边界、记忆归属和退出权的产品框架。","focus_direction":"关注哪些使用痕迹应归企业所有，以及产品如何证明未经授权不会进入供应商学习循环。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-07","date":"2026-07-13","title":"Mindwalk：在代码库 3D 地图上回放编码代理会话","original_url":"https://github.com/cosmtrek/mindwalk","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrhvwe6k00y7biidjabepmem","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"github.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"github_repo","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmrhvwe6k00y7biidjabepmem","aihot_summary":"Mindwalk 是一款可视化工具，可将 Claude Code 和 Codex 的会话日志在代码库的 3D 地图上回放。它将仓库绘制成夜间地图，代理搜索、读取和编辑过的文件会发光，未触及区域保持黑暗，让用户一眼看清代理对任务的理解范围。单个 Go 二进制文件即可运行，所有会话数据完全本地处理，不会离开机器。支持树状图/地形图两种视图，文件触达状态分为未访问、已查看、已读取、已编辑四种颜色标记。播放界面包含错误率、文件修改量等摩擦信号面板，以及上下文压缩、子代理启动、用户交互等时间轴标记。支持键盘快捷键控制播放速度、跳转编辑点或错误点。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Mindwalk 是一款可视化工具，可将 Claude Code 和 Codex 的会话日志在代码库的 3D 地图上回放。它将仓库绘制成夜间地图，代理搜索、读取和编辑过的文件会发光，未触及区域保持黑暗，让用户一眼看清代理对任务的理解范围。单个 Go 二进制文件即可运行，所有会话数据完全本地处理，不会离开机器。支持树状图/地形图两种视图，文件触达状态分为未访问、已查看、已读取、已编辑四种颜色标记。播放界面包含错误率、文件修改量等摩擦信号面板，以及上下文压缩、子代理启动、用户交互等时间轴标记。支持键盘快捷键控制播放速度、跳转编辑点或错误点。","published_at":"2026-07-12T13:51:05.035Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"github.com/cosmtrek/mindwalk","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"编码代理会话的空间化回放具备强展示性，也适合做小型复刻。","priority_rationale":"项目把代理行为、代码结构和会话轨迹组合为可视化体验，工程与产品信号都强。","pool_rationale":"可裁剪为二维代码图加会话时间轴的最小 Demo，验证调试与复盘价值。","read_reason":"可观察编码代理可解释性如何从日志列表升级为代码空间中的行为回放。","focus_direction":"关注用户任务、代码节点、时间轴和错误定位之间的交互闭环。","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
{"id":"2026-07-13-08","date":"2026-07-13","title":"OpenAI CEO Altman 改口称 AI 净创造就业，Anthropic CEO 也修正早期言论","original_url":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-ceo-altman-is-now-pretty-sure-ai-is-net-job-creating-which-is-quite-the-pivot-from-predicting-mass-layoffs","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrhlbx2v01a4bimnlcgw5m7y","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"the-decoder.com","source_mix_note":"","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"aihot_item","aihot_id":"cmrhlbx2v01a4bimnlcgw5m7y","aihot_summary":"OpenAI CEO Sam Altman 表示，他\"相当确信\"AI 迄今为止净创造了就业，并承认\"这并非我预期\"。此前他曾警告 AI 影响可能快得\"有点吓人\"。Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei 也修正了早期言论，将自动化描述为生产力倍增器而非岗位杀手。然而，多项研究未发现 AI 对整体生产力或劳动力市场产生显著影响。一项多校联合研究指出，程序员和文案的就业危机始于 2022 年初，早于 ChatGPT 发布。耶鲁预算实验室也未发现与 AI 相关的就业市场变化。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"OpenAI CEO Sam Altman 表示，他\"相当确信\"AI 迄今为止净创造了就业，并承认\"这并非我预期\"。此前他曾警告 AI 影响可能快得\"有点吓人\"。Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei 也修正了早期言论，将自动化描述为生产力倍增器而非岗位杀手。然而，多项研究未发现 AI 对整体生产力或劳动力市场产生显著影响。一项多校联合研究指出，程序员和文案的就业危机始于 2022 年初，早于 ChatGPT 发布。耶鲁预算实验室也未发现与 AI 相关的就业市场变化。","published_at":"2026-07-12T09:15:49.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P2","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"the-decoder.com/openai-ceo-altman-is-now-pretty-sure-ai-is-net-job-creating-which-is-quite-the-pivot-from-predicting-mass-layoffs","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"该 canonical_key 在近 7 天状态中未出现。","practice_fit":"low","reason":"就业观点变化适合作为行业叙事背景，不宜占用有限阅读时间。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":"","open_questions":"","knowledge_gap_card":"","requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":"","status":"inbox"}
