{"id":"2026-07-15-aihot-cmrlg0ucc080qbi2bb8hn7nj3","date":"2026-07-15","title":"开源 LLM TODO Skill\"阿福\"：用 Claude Code 和 Codex 实现知识管理到排期自动化","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QcGHxKohg0gW9e84Nd_9jA","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrlg0ucc080qbi2bb8hn7nj3","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：卡尔的AI沃茨","source_mix_note":"","source_role":"daily_discovery","aihot_id":"cmrlg0ucc080qbi2bb8hn7nj3","aihot_summary":"作者基于 API 版 Fable5 和 Codex 开发了开源 TODO Skill\"阿福\"，用于将收件箱中的待办资料自动转为 Markdown 任务卡，识别信息不完整项（如视频链接需通过 yt-dlp 和本地 Whisper 提取字幕），并支持批量排期、AI 分组合并、拖拽调整周视图及同步到 Mac 日历或飞书日历。项目已开源在 GitHub，安装仅需一条命令。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"该开源 Skill 把非结构化收件箱、信息补全、排期和日历同步串成可复刻的个人执行工作流。","display_summary":"作者基于 API 版 Fable5 和 Codex 开发了开源 TODO Skill\"阿福\"，用于将收件箱中的待办资料自动转为 Markdown 任务卡，识别信息不完整项（如视频链接需通过 yt-dlp 和本地 Whisper 提取字幕），并支持批量排期、AI 分组合并、拖拽调整周视图及同步到 Mac 日历或飞书日历。项目已开源在 GitHub，安装仅需一条命令。","published_at":"2026-07-15T01:52:00.000Z","priority":"P0","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QcGHxKohg0gW9e84Nd_9jA","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"能直接训练需求拆解、工具编排和可展示 Demo 制作。","priority_rationale":"该案例给出从输入补全到排期同步的完整工作流，能直接转化为短周期复刻任务。","pool_rationale":"其 Markdown 任务卡、批量排期与日历同步链路符合 3—8 小时 Demo 复刻条件。","content_tags":["workflow","Vibe Coding"],"tags":["workflow","Vibe Coding"],"read_reason":"用于提炼个人任务 Agent 的最小闭环和可展示交付物。","focus_direction":"关注缺失信息检测、任务合并和日历同步之间的状态结构。","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"confidence":"medium","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_order":2,"reading_category":"P0