{"id":"2026-07-15-aihot-cmrlbqrmp02hubi2bvj72j1hx","date":"2026-07-15","title":"每天Vibe Coding 16小时，作者分享Fable 5与GPT-5.6 Sol的AI开发流程","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wm_LM83gyLM-auidBxprZw","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrlbqrmp02hubi2bvj72j1hx","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","source_mix_note":"","source_role":"daily_discovery","aihot_id":"cmrlbqrmp02hubi2bvj72j1hx","aihot_summary":"作者每天Vibe Coding约16小时，认为Claude Fable 5在大型方案初版设计上\"当世独一档\"，GPT-5.6 Sol能有效纠错并优化方案。核心流程为：Fable 5出方案初版 → GPT-5.6 Sol审查纠错 → 在Codex中开启\"目标模式\"全自动化执行，最长曾连续运行17小时。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"该作者经验强调多模型审查与长时自动执行，但证据主要来自个人工作流叙述。","display_summary":"作者每天Vibe Coding约16小时，认为Claude Fable 5在大型方案初版设计上\"当世独一档\"，GPT-5.6 Sol能有效纠错并优化方案。核心流程为：Fable 5出方案初版 → GPT-5.6 Sol审查纠错 → 在Codex中开启\"目标模式\"全自动化执行，最长曾连续运行17小时。","published_at":"2026-07-15T00:02:00.000Z","priority":"archive","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wm_LM83gyLM-auidBxprZw","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"可作为工作流灵感，暂不作为可靠工程结论。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["AI coding","workflow"],"tags":["AI coding","workflow"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"confidence":"medium","url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"requires_manual_review":true,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false}
