{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmybfkm039cbijeh07y5kq0","date":"2026-07-16","title":"千问APP联合武汉发布举办AI求职实战课，演示简历诊断与办公自动化","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dCk6IXbFyOSSc1JxcWsglA","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmybfkm039cbijeh07y5kq0","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：千问APP（阿里）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"wechat_article","aihot_id":"cmrmybfkm039cbijeh07y5kq0","aihot_summary":"千问APP与武汉发布在武汉举办AI求职实战课，现场演示了用千问进行简历诊断、PPT制作和表格分析。产品经理提出\"给全材料、说明目标、定义标准、划定边界、索要可编辑文件\"五步法，并展示了将486行杂乱销售数据浓缩为一页结论PPT的\"建、理、算、析、呈\"方法论。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"千问APP与武汉发布在武汉举办AI求职实战课，现场演示了用千问进行简历诊断、PPT制作和表格分析。产品经理提出\"给全材料、说明目标、定义标准、划定边界、索要可编辑文件\"五步法，并展示了将486行杂乱销售数据浓缩为一页结论PPT的\"建、理、算、析、呈\"方法论。","published_at":"2026-07-16T03:27:08.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"mp-weixin-qq-com-s-dck6ixbfyossc1jxcwsgla","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"可转化为 AI PM 工作流或独立开发者能力建设素材。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["enterprise AI","workflow"],"tags":["enterprise AI","workflow"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmvgk9r01t6bijelx7vxglt","date":"2026-07-16","title":"天工短剧工作台发布\"Agent智能分镜+无限画布\"双轨创作模式","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WlGAeogkF_N5122nHA0TtQ","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmvgk9r01t6bijelx7vxglt","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：昆仑万维（天工）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"wechat_article","aihot_id":"cmrmvgk9r01t6bijelx7vxglt","aihot_summary":"天工短剧工作台推出双轨创作模式，通过导演Agent自动解析剧本、规划站位与机位，并支持多视细节图生成，解决AI短剧角色变脸和站位漂移问题。该工具内置影视级提示词模板、720°全景图及3D导演台，实现可控生产。已有三部作品上线DramaWave 7天实现百万美元级营收。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"天工短剧工作台推出双轨创作模式，通过导演Agent自动解析剧本、规划站位与机位，并支持多视细节图生成，解决AI短剧角色变脸和站位漂移问题。该工具内置影视级提示词模板、720°全景图及3D导演台，实现可控生产。已有三部作品上线DramaWave 7天实现百万美元级营收。","published_at":"2026-07-16T02:00:00.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"mp-weixin-qq-com-s-wlgaeogkf-n5122nha0ttq","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"可转化为 AI PM 工作流或独立开发者能力建设素材。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["agent","workflow"],"tags":["agent","workflow"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmudyvj015jbije15lwn7k2","date":"2026-07-16","title":"MiniMax Code 2.0 桌面端焕新：底层架构全面升级，金融模块即将上线","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mQeBO0xC6Z1R0LqZX5TvNg","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmudyvj015jbije15lwn7k2","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：MiniMax（稀宇科技）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"wechat_article","aihot_id":"cmrmudyvj015jbije15lwn7k2","aihot_summary":"MiniMax Code 2.0 桌面端发布，基于 Pi Agent 框架重构底层架构，显著提升会话启动速度与长程复杂任务的执行稳定性。新版本优化了图表加载与文件预览框选编辑功能，并已与恒生金融数据库、企查查 MCP 打通，金融模块即将上线，支持多源数据实时检索与专业报告生成。桌面端现已开放下载，本月还将上线远程控制、浏览器操控等功能。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"MiniMax Code 2.0 桌面端发布，基于 Pi Agent 框架重构底层架构，显著提升会话启动速度与长程复杂任务的执行稳定性。新版本优化了图表加载与文件预览框选编辑功能，并已与恒生金融数据库、企查查 MCP 打通，金融模块即将上线，支持多源数据实时检索与专业报告生成。桌面端现已开放下载，本月还将上线远程控制、浏览器操控等功能。","published_at":"2026-07-16T01:36:13.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"demo_replication","candidate_pool":"demo_replication","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"demo_replication","canonical_key":"mp-weixin-qq-com-s-mqebo0xc6z1r0lqzx5tvng","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"high","reason":"入选阅读包，路由依据见 priority_rationale 与 pool_rationale。","priority_rationale":"编码 Agent 架构升级与金融 MCP 场景绑定，适合扫读其产品化边界。","pool_rationale":"可拆成一次金融数据检索到报告生成的最小 Demo 复刻。","content_tags":["AI coding","2B"],"tags":["AI coding","2B"],"read_reason":"用于观察编码 Agent 从通用代码助手转向垂直业务助手的产品路径。","focus_direction":"关注架构重构、MCP 数据源、报告生成和企业场景之间的闭环。","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"n