{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmibbm801m8biulhl6uejzo","date":"2026-07-16","title":"前谷歌DeepMind研究员因公司签署无限制军事AI协议而离职","original_url":"https://turntrout.com/why-i-left-google-deepmind","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmibbm801m8biulhl6uejzo","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"web","aihot_id":"cmrmibbm801m8biulhl6uejzo","aihot_summary":"前谷歌DeepMind研究员Alex Turner因谷歌向国土安全部出售云服务并最终签署无限制军事AI协议而离职。他曾起草25页提案要求加入禁止杀手机器人和大规模监控的合同条款，但提案被CEO转交后无人跟进。Turner指出，包括Jeff Dean和Stuart Russell在内的多位AI伦理领袖在关键时刻未能兑现承诺。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"前谷歌DeepMind研究员Alex Turner因谷歌向国土安全部出售云服务并最终签署无限制军事AI协议而离职。他曾起草25页提案要求加入禁止杀手机器人和大规模监控的合同条款，但提案被CEO转交后无人跟进。Turner指出，包括Jeff Dean和Stuart Russell在内的多位AI伦理领袖在关键时刻未能兑现承诺。","published_at":"2026-07-15T19:37:38.646Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"turntrout-com-why-i-left-google-deepmind","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"风险或评测信号值得保留，但需要人工判断是否展开。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["security","eval"],"tags":["security","eval"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmeaixl05bdbivcipzbkgk8","date":"2026-07-16","title":"Thinking Machines 发布多模态模型 Inkling","original_url":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/2077454609551921208","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmeaixl05bdbivcipzbkgk8","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：Thinking Machines (@thinkymachines)","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"social_post","aihot_id":"cmrmeaixl05bdbivcipzbkgk8","aihot_summary":"今天，我们推出 Inkling。\n\nInkling 能高效地对文本、图像和音频模态进行推理。我们将提供完整权重。\n\nhttps://thinkingmachines.ai/news/introducing-inkling/\n\n即日起可在 Tinker 上进行微调。在 Inkling Playground 中试用。🧵","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"今天，我们推出 Inkling。\n\nInkling 能高效地对文本、图像和音频模态进行推理。我们将提供完整权重。\n\nhttps://thinkingmachines.ai/news/introducing-inkling/\n\n即日起可在 Tinker 上进行微调。在 Inkling Playground 中试用。🧵","published_at":"2026-07-15T18:05:50.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P2","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"x-com-thinkymachines-status-2077454609551921208","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"low","reason":"保留为背景信息，暂不进入行动项。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["multimodal","consumer AI"],"tags":["multimodal","consumer AI"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmee60505d9bivcmy92uddy","date":"2026-07-16","title":"Anthropic 研究：AI 智能体模拟中行为偏差","original_url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2077452646303006927","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmee60505d9bivcmy92uddy","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"x_post","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"social_post","aihot_id":"cmrmee60505d9bivcmy92uddy","aihot_summary":"Anthropic 新研究：2026 年夏季的智能体行为偏差。\n\n在我们的敲诈实验一年后，我们又发现了四种当今自主 AI 智能体在模拟中行为不当的方式。\n\n了解更多：https://alignment.anthropic.com/2026/agentic-misalignment-summer-2026/","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Anthropic 新研究：2026 年夏季的智能体行为偏差。\n\n在我们的敲诈实验一年后，我们又发现了四种当今自主 AI 智能体在模拟中行为不当的方式。\n\n了解更多：https://alignment.anthropic.com/2026/agentic-misalignment-summer-2026/","published_at":"2026-07-15T17:58:02.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P0","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"x-com-anthropicai-status-2077452646303006927","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"入选阅读包，路由依据见 priority_rationale 与 pool_rationale。","priority_rationale":"自主 Agent 行为偏差属于 Agent 产品上线前必须理解的风险类型。","pool_rationale":"该信号需要后续研究安全边界与模拟实验设计，先进入知识空缺池等待人工确认。","content_tags":["agent","security"],"tags":["agent","security"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":"P0 详细阅读","reading_order":2}
{"id":"2026-07-16-aihot-cmrmbtk3z0002bivco9advwbd","date":"2026-07-16","title":"AI语音诈骗：退休老人因合成女儿哭声被骗1.5万美元","original_url":"https://smarterarticles.co.uk/the-three-second-theft-why-ai-voice-fraud-outruns-every-defence","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrmbtk3z0002bivco9advwbd","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"web","aihot_id":"cmrmbtk3z0002bivco9advwbd","aihot_summary":"2025年夏季，美国佛罗里达州一名退休老人接到\"女儿\"哭诉车祸需保释金的电话，一小时内取现1.5万美元交给冒充法院的快递员--实际上，哭声是从一段音频片段合成的AI语音。FBI 2026年4月报告首次将AI欺诈列为独立类别，2025年收到超2.2万起AI相关投诉，调整后损失超8.93亿美元，其中60岁以上受害者占3.52亿美元。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"2025年夏季，美国佛罗里达州一名退休老人接到\"女儿\"哭诉车祸需保释金的电话，一小时内取现1.5万美元交给冒充法院的快递员--实际上，哭声是从一段音频片段合成的AI语音。FBI 2026年4月报告首次将AI欺诈列为独立类别，2025年收到超2.2万起AI相关投诉，调整后损失超8.93亿美元，其中60岁以上受害者占3.52亿美元。","published_at":"2026-07-15T16:25:19.955Z","observed_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"smarterarticles-co-uk-the-three-second-theft-why-ai-voice-fraud-outruns-every-defence","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"消息源日期位于本次采集窗口，近 7 天记忆与近期日报未发现同一 canonical_key。","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"风险或评测信号值得保留，但需要人工判断是否展开。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["security","eval"],"tags":["security","eval"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_categor