{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmro8l78w00j5bitou01qowy4","date":"2026-07-17","title":"生成式人工智能是一场工程灾难：AI公司抢购70%高端内存，推高电脑价格","original_url":"https://www.theatlantic.com/technology/2026/07/generative-ai-engineering-disaster/687901","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmro8l78w00j5bitou01qowy4","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmro8l78w00j5bitou01qowy4","aihot_summary":"AI公司为维持大语言模型（如ChatGPT、Claude）运行，可能已购买全球70%的高端计算机内存，导致内存与存储价格飙升：两年前350美元的硬盘现已涨至800美元且缺货，部分笔记本电脑涨价50%。科技公司计划未来几年将美国数据中心容量扩大8倍，部分站点甚至用喷气发动机供电。预测称，平价入门级电脑可能在2028年前消失，内存短缺预计持续数年。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"AI公司为维持大语言模型（如ChatGPT、Claude）运行，可能已购买全球70%的高端计算机内存，导致内存与存储价格飙升：两年前350美元的硬盘现已涨至800美元且缺货，部分笔记本电脑涨价50%。科技公司计划未来几年将美国数据中心容量扩大8倍，部分站点甚至用喷气发动机供电。预测称，平价入门级电脑可能在2028年前消失，内存短缺预计持续数年。","published_at":"2026-07-17T00:40:20.333Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"theatlantic-com-technology-2026-07-generative-ai-engineering-disaster-687901","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"AI 基础设施成本正外溢到终端硬件供给，适合保留为商业与供应链风险信号。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["infra","business model"],"tags":["infra","business model"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmro185e3011jbij2ond4t12b","date":"2026-07-17","title":"Grok 推出 Automations 功能：定时或邮件触发，自动执行任务并汇报结果","original_url":"https://x.ai/news/grok-automations","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmro185e3011jbij2ond4t12b","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"xAI：News（网页）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"ai-products","aihot_id":"cmro185e3011jbij2ond4t12b","aihot_summary":"xAI 为 Grok 引入 Automations 功能，用户可描述一次任务，让 Grok 按计划（一次/每日/工作日/每周/每月/每年）或邮件触发（按发件人、收件人或主题过滤）自动运行。每次执行都是一次完整对话，结果保存至运行历史，支持邮件或应用内通知。定时自动化对所有用户开放，邮件触发需 SuperGrok 订阅。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"xAI 为 Grok 引入 Automations 功能，用户可描述一次任务，让 Grok 按计划（一次/每日/工作日/每周/每月/每年）或邮件触发（按发件人、收件人或主题过滤）自动运行。每次执行都是一次完整对话，结果保存至运行历史，支持邮件或应用内通知。定时自动化对所有用户开放，邮件触发需 SuperGrok 订阅。","published_at":"2026-07-16T21:39:40.165Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"x-ai-news-grok-automations","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"Grok Automations 显示 AI 助手开始内建计划任务和邮件触发器。","priority_rationale":"Grok Automations 是官方产品更新，功能清楚但深度有限，适合扫读。","pool_rationale":"可转化为个人自动化工作台的触发器、运行历史和通知设计卡。","content_tags":["agent","workflow"],"tags":["agent","workflow"],"read_reason":"用于比较定时触发、邮件触发和完整对话运行历史如何组成自动化体验。","focus_direction":"关注触发条件、运行结果保存、通知方式和订阅限制。","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":"P1 扫读","reading_order":1}
{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnz309k00f0biq1v5egac59","date":"2026-07-17","title":"xAI 起诉 Grok 用户制作儿童性虐待内容，不再否认模型被滥用","original_url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/07/xai-cant-deny-grok-makes-csam-anymore-so-its-suing-users","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnz309k00f0biq1v5egac59","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrnz309k00f0biq1v5egac59","aihot_summary":"xAI 首次对一名 Grok 用户提起诉讼，指控其利用该模型制作儿童性虐待图像（CSAM）。此前 xAI 一直否认 Grok 能生成此类内容，此次诉讼标志着其立场转变。案件聚焦用户滥用行为，而非模型本身的技术缺陷。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"xAI 首次对一名 Grok 用户提起诉讼，指控其利用该模型制作儿童性虐待图像（CSAM）。此前 xAI 一直否认 Grok 能生成此类内容，此次诉讼标志着其立场转变。案件聚焦用户滥用行为，而非模型本身的技术缺陷。","published_at":"2026-07-16T20:26:23.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"arstechnica-com-tech-policy-2026-07-xai-cant-deny-grok-makes-csam-anymore-so-its-suing-users","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"Grok CSAM 诉讼属于模型滥用和平台责任风险，适合进入安全知识空缺。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["security","consumer AI"],"tags":["security","consumer AI"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnvwztt01bebixyznbje716","date":"2026-07-17","title":"Moonshot AI 发布 PerceptionBench：多模态模型视觉感知能力诊断基准","original_url":"https://www.kimi.com/blog/perception-bench","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnvwztt01bebixyznbje716","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Moonshot AI：Kimi Blog","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"paper","aihot_id":"cmrnvwztt01bebixyznbje716","aihot_summary":"Moonshot AI 发布 PerceptionBench，一个从 40 多个现有基准中模型实际失败案例归纳出的视觉感知基准，包含 10 项原子感知能力和 3000 道验证题。所有测试模型准确率均未超过 60%，且大量正确答案在重复提问时无法复现，表明模型更多是猜测而非真正感知。PerceptionBench 旨在精确诊断多模态 AI 的视觉感知断裂点，推动其实现忠实、一致的视觉理解。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Moonshot AI 发布 PerceptionBench，一个从 40 多个现有基准中模型实际失败案例归纳出的视觉感知基准，包含 10 项原子感知能力和 3000 道验证题。所有测试模型准确率均未超过 60%，且大量正确答案在重复提问时无法复现，表明模型更多是猜测而非真正感知。PerceptionBench 旨在精确诊断多模态 AI 的视觉感知断裂点，推动其实现忠实、一致的视觉理解。","published_at":"2026-07-16T19:11:01.192Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"paper_candidate","candidate_pool":"paper_candidate","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"paper_candidate","canonical_key":"kimi-com-blog-perception-bench","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"PerceptionBench 暴露多模态模型视觉感知一致性不足的问题。","priority_rationale":"PerceptionBench 是多模态诊断基准发布，适合扫读其失败案例来源与指标设计。","pool_rationale":"该基准适合进入论文候选池，后续用于多模态产品评测框架。","content_tags":["multimodal","eval"],"tags":["multimodal","eval"],"read_reason":"用于补足多模态模型评测从榜单分数到失败类型诊断的思路。","focus_direction":"关注 10 项原子能力、重复提问一致性和产品场景中如何映射视觉失败。","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认