{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnvq3xd015sbixyztrtb01z","date":"2026-07-17","title":"Decoy 字体：用空间频率混淆让 AI 看不清你输入的文字","original_url":"https://www.mixfont.com/experiments/decoy-font","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnvq3xd015sbixyztrtb01z","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"ai-products","aihot_id":"cmrnvq3xd015sbixyztrtb01z","aihot_summary":"Decoy Font 是一款 TTF 字体，通过在同一字符中叠加不同空间频率的图形（前景细轮廓与背景低频模糊块），使近距离观看时 AI 读到\"诱饵\"字母，而人眼远距离或眯眼时才能看到真实隐藏信息。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Decoy Font 是一款 TTF 字体，通过在同一字符中叠加不同空间频率的图形（前景细轮廓与背景低频模糊块），使近距离观看时 AI 读到\"诱饵\"字母，而人眼远距离或眯眼时才能看到真实隐藏信息。","published_at":"2026-07-16T18:32:23.680Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P2","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"mixfont-com-experiments-decoy-font","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"Decoy 字体是有趣的视觉对抗样例，但与本周行动关联较弱。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["security","UX"],"tags":["security","UX"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnse7qy002tbixy7gnolvr3","date":"2026-07-17","title":"Anthropic 用 Claude Code 大规模迁移代码：Bun 百万行 Zig 转 Rust，两周完成","original_url":"https://claude.com/blog/ai-code-migration","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnse7qy002tbixy7gnolvr3","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"official_blog","source_tier":"Tier 1","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"tip","aihot_id":"cmrnse7qy002tbixy7gnolvr3","aihot_summary":"Anthropic 工程师用 Claude Code 在两周内将 Bun 的百万行 Zig 代码迁移至 Rust，100% 现有测试通过，合并后出现 19 个回归问题已全部修复。另一工程师用周末将 Python 代码库迁移至 16.5 万行 TypeScript。迁移消耗约 16.5 万美元 API 成本，但编译时间从八分钟降至两秒，二进制启动快 6 倍。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"Anthropic 工程师用 Claude Code 在两周内将 Bun 的百万行 Zig 代码迁移至 Rust，100% 现有测试通过，合并后出现 19 个回归问题已全部修复。另一工程师用周末将 Python 代码库迁移至 16.5 万行 TypeScript。迁移消耗约 16.5 万美元 API 成本，但编译时间从八分钟降至两秒，二进制启动快 6 倍。","published_at":"2026-07-16T17:32:26.540Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P0","confidence":"high","reading_pack_status":"selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"claude-com-blog-ai-code-migration","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"high","reason":"Claude Code 大规模迁移案例给出 AI coding 的成本与验收口径。","priority_rationale":"Claude Code 大规模代码迁移有成本、测试和回归数据，适合作为 AI coding 工程验收样板。","pool_rationale":"该案例可直接沉淀为个人工作中的迁移流程卡和测试门禁清单。","content_tags":["AI coding","Development"],"tags":["AI coding","Development"],"read_reason":"用于学习如何把 AI coding 从“生成代码”提升到“迁移项目并用测试闭环验收”。","focus_direction":"关注迁移范围、成本口径、测试通过率、回归修复和可复用到小项目的最小流程。","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_actio