{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnmdjt80051bizz895rbmu6","date":"2026-07-17","title":"世界人工智能合作组织协定签署仪式在上海举行，总部设中国上海","original_url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/977/793.htm","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnmdjt80051bizz895rbmu6","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"IT之家（RSS）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrnmdjt80051bizz895rbmu6","aihot_summary":"7月16日，成立世界人工智能合作组织协定签署仪式在上海举行，中共中央政治局委员、外交部长王毅代表中国政府签署协定。该组织是独立的政府间国际组织，总部设在中国上海，旨在促进人工智能国际合作与全球治理。哈萨克斯坦、老挝、巴基斯坦等29个国家代表签署协定成为创始成员国。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"7月16日，成立世界人工智能合作组织协定签署仪式在上海举行，中共中央政治局委员、外交部长王毅代表中国政府签署协定。该组织是独立的政府间国际组织，总部设在中国上海，旨在促进人工智能国际合作与全球治理。哈萨克斯坦、老挝、巴基斯坦等29个国家代表签署协定成为创始成员国。","published_at":"2026-07-16T14:38:08.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"archive","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"archive","candidate_pool":"archive","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"archive","canonical_key":"ithome-com-0-977-793-htm","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"国际 AI 治理组织成立是宏观背景，暂不进入行动项。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["business model","AI PM"],"tags":["business model","AI PM"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
