{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrnhly4m0007bii5zd6dhl1p","date":"2026-07-17","title":"秒哒 3.5 全球首发 iOS App，无代码开发与多端共享后端能力升级","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/W3QACoSYgwK0TW4zG-KFsg","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrnhly4m0007bii5zd6dhl1p","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"公众号：百度智能云（文心）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 3","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"ai-products","aihot_id":"cmrnhly4m0007bii5zd6dhl1p","aihot_summary":"百度智能云在 WAIC2026 发布秒哒 3.5，新增 iOS 打包能力，用户无需 Mac 或 Xcode 即可将应用打包为 IPA 文件或上架 App Store。3.5 版本还内置 SEO Agent 实现搜索优化自动化，支持多应用共享同一后端数据库，并推出数据库多环境隔离与后端资源分级功能。秒哒累计服务超 3500 万用户，已创造 350 万个商业应用。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"百度智能云在 WAIC2026 发布秒哒 3.5，新增 iOS 打包能力，用户无需 Mac 或 Xcode 即可将应用打包为 IPA 文件或上架 App Store。3.5 版本还内置 SEO Agent 实现搜索优化自动化，支持多应用共享同一后端数据库，并推出数据库多环境隔离与后端资源分级功能。秒哒累计服务超 3500 万用户，已创造 350 万个商业应用。","published_at":"2026-07-16T12:17:11.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"personal_work","candidate_pool":"personal_work","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"personal_work","canonical_key":"mp-weixin-qq-com-s-w3qacosygwk0tw4zg-kfsg","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"medium","reason":"秒哒 3.5 强调无代码多端应用和共享后端，适合做产品形态观察。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["Vibe Coding","Product"],"tags":["Vibe Coding","Product"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false,"reading_category":""}
{"id":"2026-07-17-aihot-cmrngw19f00fcbiu5iso650ol","date":"2026-07-17","title":"欧盟裁定 Google 必须向竞争对手开放 Android 和 Search，影响 Gemini 等 AI 服务","original_url":"https://www.theverge.com/policy/966438/eu-google-android-ai-interoperability-search-data-dma","source_url":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmrngw19f00fcbiu5iso650ol","source_origin":"aggregator","source_name":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","source_mix_note":"main_aihot","source_type":"media_article","source_tier":"Tier 2","source_role":"daily_discovery","review_cadence":"daily","original_format":"industry","aihot_id":"cmrngw19f00fcbiu5iso650ol","aihot_summary":"欧盟依据《数字市场法案》（DMA）裁定 Google 必须向竞争对手开放 Android 和 Google Search 的关键部分，包括允许第三方 AI 助手和搜索引擎获得更大访问权限。这两项决定可能削弱 Google 对两大核心平台的控制，并为其 AI 工具 Gemini 的未来格局带来深远影响，同时为竞争对手创造新的发展机会。","aihot_summary_status":"verified","discovery_summary":"","codex_summary":"","display_summary":"欧盟依据《数字市场法案》（DMA）裁定 Google 必须向竞争对手开放 Android 和 Google Search 的关键部分，包括允许第三方 AI 助手和搜索引擎获得更大访问权限。这两项决定可能削弱 Google 对两大核心平台的控制，并为其 AI 工具 Gemini 的未来格局带来深远影响，同时为竞争对手创造新的发展机会。","published_at":"2026-07-16T12:06:51.000Z","observed_at":"2026-07-17T13:35:46+08:00","priority":"P1","confidence":"medium","reading_pack_status":"not_selected","suggested_pool":"knowledge_gap","candidate_pool":"knowledge_gap","human_status":"pending","final_pool":"knowledge_gap","canonical_key":"theverge-com-policy-966438-eu-google-android-ai-interoperability-search-data-dma","duplicate_status":"new","duplicate_window_status":"new","freshness_status":"fresh_24h","novelty_reason":"","practice_fit":"low","reason":"欧盟互操作性裁定影响 Android、Search 与 Gemini 服务边界，适合跟踪平台监管。","priority_rationale":"","pool_rationale":"","content_tags":["integration","business model"],"tags":["integration","business model"],"read_reason":"","focus_direction":"","known_facts":[],"open_questions":[],"knowledge_gap_card":{},"requires_manual_review":true,"url_status":"verification_unavailable","url_checked_at":null,"next_action":"人工确认候选池路由","status":"inbox","formal_practice":false